{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1385625, "parts": [{"text": "Item 1A. Risk Factors. ", "start": 1385731, "end": 1385754, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1385761, "text": "Item 1A. Risk Factors."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1385798, "parts": [{"text": "The following discussion sets forth the material risk factors that could affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1385923, "end": 1386016, "emphasis": false, "italic": true}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1386016, "end": 1386023, "emphasis": false, "italic": true}, {"text": "s financial condition and operations. Readers should not consider any descriptions of these factors to be a complete set of all potential risks that could affect the Firm. Any of the risk factors discussed below could by itself, or combined with other factors, materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1386023, "end": 1386329, "emphasis": false, "italic": true}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1386329, "end": 1386336, "emphasis": false, "italic": true}, {"text": "s business, results of operations, financial condition, capital position, liquidity, competitive position or reputation, including by materially increasing expenses or decreasing revenues, which could result in material losses or a decrease in earnings.", "start": 1386336, "end": 1386589, "emphasis": false, "italic": true}], "end": 1386596, "text": "The following discussion sets forth the material risk factors that could affect JPMorganChase’s financial condition and operations. Readers should not consider any descriptions of these factors to be a complete set of all potential risks that could affect the Firm. Any of the risk factors discussed below could by itself, or combined with other factors, materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase’s business, results of operations, financial condition, capital position, liquidity, competitive position or reputation, including by materially increasing expenses or decreasing revenues, which could result in material losses or a decrease in earnings."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#8f5a39;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1386633, "parts": [{"text": "Summary", "start": 1386740, "end": 1386747, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1386754, "text": "Summary"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1386791, "parts": [{"text": "The principal risk factors include:", "start": 1386898, "end": 1386933, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1386940, "text": "The principal risk factors include:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1387011, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1387118, "end": 1387125, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1387132, "text": "•"}
