{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1392117, "parts": [{"text": " risks, including the risk that JPMorganChase", "start": 1392224, "end": 1392269, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1392269, "end": 1392276, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to distribute capital to shareholders or to support its business activities could be limited if it does not satisfy applicable regulatory capital requirements.", "start": 1392276, "end": 1392445, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1392452, "text": "risks, including the risk that JPMorganChase’s ability to distribute capital to shareholders or to support its business activities could be limited if it does not satisfy applicable regulatory capital requirements."}
