{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1399188, "parts": [{"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1399295, "end": 1399302, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "applicable law", "start": 1399302, "end": 1399316, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1399316, "end": 1399323, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": " means the laws, rules and regulations that apply to JPMorganChase", "start": 1399323, "end": 1399389, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1399389, "end": 1399396, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses in the jurisdictions in which it operates.", "start": 1399396, "end": 1399451, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1399458, "text": "“applicable law” means the laws, rules and regulations that apply to JPMorganChase’s businesses in the jurisdictions in which it operates."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1399495, "parts": [{"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1399602, "end": 1399609, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "extraordinary events", "start": 1399609, "end": 1399629, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1399629, "end": 1399636, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": " include any of the events or circumstances mentioned in the risk factor entitled ", "start": 1399636, "end": 1399718, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1399718, "end": 1399725, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1399725, "end": 1399738, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1399738, "end": 1399745, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operations, results and reputation could be harmed by occurrences of extraordinary events beyond its control.", "start": 1399745, "end": 1399856, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1399856, "end": 1399863, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1399870, "text": "“extraordinary events” include any of the events or circumstances mentioned in the risk factor entitled “JPMorganChase’s operations, results and reputation could be harmed by occurrences of extraordinary events beyond its control.”"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1399907, "parts": [{"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1400014, "end": 1400021, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "governmental authorities", "start": 1400021, "end": 1400045, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1400045, "end": 1400052, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": " means governmental and regulatory agencies, legislative and judicial bodies and other governmental entities and authorities in the countries, states, municipalities, territories, regions and other jurisdictions in which JPMorganChase does business.", "start": 1400052, "end": 1400301, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1400308, "text": "“governmental authorities” means governmental and regulatory agencies, legislative and judicial bodies and other governmental entities and authorities in the countries, states, municipalities, territories, regions and other jurisdictions in which JPMorganChase does business."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1400345, "parts": [{"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1400452, "end": 1400459, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "penalties", "start": 1400459, "end": 1400468, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1400468, "end": 1400475, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": " means fines, penalties or other sanctions imposed by governmental authorities.", "start": 1400475, "end": 1400554, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1400561, "text": "“penalties” means fines, penalties or other sanctions imposed by governmental authorities."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#8f5a39;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1400598, "parts": [{"text": "Legal and Regulatory", "start": 1400705, "end": 1400725, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1400732, "text": "Legal and Regulatory"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1400769, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1400876, "end": 1400889, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1400889, "end": 1400896, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses are highly regulated and are significantly affected by applicable law and supervisory expectations.", "start": 1400896, "end": 1401008, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1401015, "text": "JPMorganChase’s businesses are highly regulated and are significantly affected by applicable law and supervisory expectations."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1401052, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase must comply with applicable law in all of the jurisdictions around the world where it does business. Like other financial services firms, JPMorganChase is subject to extensive supervision and regulation that significantly affects the way that it conducts its business and structures its operations. The supervisory and regulatory framework also imposes requirements for JPMorganChase to implement and maintain compliance programs, and the complexity of these programs can increase its risks of non-compliance. In addition, entering into or acquiring a new business or expanding current business could increase the scope of applicable law or supervision and regulation to which JPMorganChase is subject.", "start": 1401159, "end": 1401875, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1401882, "text": "JPMorganChase must comply with applicable law in all of the jurisdictions around the world where it does business. Like other financial services firms, JPMorganChase is subject to extensive supervision and regulation that significantly affects the way that it conducts its business and structures its operations. The supervisory and regulatory framework also imposes requirements for JPMorganChase to implement and maintain compliance programs, and the complexity of these programs can increase its risks of non-compliance. In addition, entering into or acquiring a new business or expanding current business could increase the scope of applicable law or supervision and regulation to which JPMorganChase is subject."}
