{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1418658, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase faces significant legal risks from civil and governmental proceedings, including litigation, investigations and enforcement actions.", "start": 1418765, "end": 1418911, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1418918, "text": "JPMorganChase faces significant legal risks from civil and governmental proceedings, including litigation, investigations and enforcement actions."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1418955, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase is named as a defendant or is otherwise involved in many civil and governmental legal proceedings, including class actions, derivative actions and other litigation or disputes with third parties, as well as investigations and enforcement actions by U.S. and non-U.S. governmental authorities, including criminal proceedings. Actions currently ", "start": 1419062, "end": 1419419, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1419426, "text": "JPMorganChase is named as a defendant or is otherwise involved in many civil and governmental legal proceedings, including class actions, derivative actions and other litigation or disputes with third parties, as well as investigations and enforcement actions by U.S. and non-U.S. governmental authorities, including criminal proceedings. Actions currently"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1419629, "parts": [{"text": "pending against JPMorganChase could result in judgments, settlements or penalties adverse to JPMorganChase, and any such resolution of legal proceedings could materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1419736, "end": 1419940, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1419940, "end": 1419947, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business, financial condition or results of operations, or cause serious reputational harm. In addition, the extent of JPMorganChase", "start": 1419947, "end": 1420081, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1420081, "end": 1420088, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s exposure to legal matters is unpredictable and could, in some cases, exceed the amount of reserves that JPMorganChase has established for those matters.", "start": 1420088, "end": 1420242, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1420249, "text": "pending against JPMorganChase could result in judgments, settlements or penalties adverse to JPMorganChase, and any such resolution of legal proceedings could materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase’s business, financial condition or results of operations, or cause serious reputational harm. In addition, the extent of JPMorganChase’s exposure to legal matters is unpredictable and could, in some cases, exceed the amount of reserves that JPMorganChase has established for those matters."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1420286, "parts": [{"text": "Resolving an investigation by a governmental authority could subject JPMorganChase to significant penalties and other repercussions.", "start": 1420393, "end": 1420525, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1420532, "text": "Resolving an investigation by a governmental authority could subject JPMorganChase to significant penalties and other repercussions."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1420569, "parts": [{"text": "Governmental authorities conduct both routine and targeted examinations of JPMorganChase and its subsidiaries, and JPMorganChase", "start": 1420676, "end": 1420804, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1420804, "end": 1420811, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses and operations are subject to heightened regulatory oversight. This scrutiny, or the results of such an examination, could lead to legal proceedings, including investigations or enforcement actions by governmental authorities. Furthermore, a single event involving a potential violation of applicable law could give rise to numerous and overlapping proceedings, including by multiple governmental authorities in the U.S. as well as non-U.S. authorities. In addition, if another financial institution violates applicable law relating to a particular business activity or practice, this will often give rise to legal proceedings related to the same or similar activity or practice by JPMorganChase.", "start": 1420811, "end": 1421520, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1421527, "text": "Governmental authorities conduct both routine and targeted examinations of JPMorganChase and its subsidiaries, and JPMorganChase’s businesses and operations are subject to heightened regulatory oversight. This scrutiny, or the results of such an examination, could lead to legal proceedings, including investigations or enforcement actions by governmental authorities. Furthermore, a single event involving a potential violation of applicable law could give rise to numerous and overlapping proceedings, including by multiple governmental authorities in the U.S. as well as non-U.S. authorities. In addition, if another financial institution violates applicable law relating to a particular business activity or practice, this will often give rise to legal proceedings related to the same or similar activity or practice by JPMorganChase."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1421564, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase has in the past incurred significant penalties and experienced collateral consequences and other repercussions in connection with resolving investigations and enforcement actions by governmental authorities, and it could face similar investigations, actions and resolutions in the future. JPMorganChase typically incurs higher operational and compliance costs when addressing the requirements of such resolutions, including devoting substantial resources to remediation.", "start": 1421671, "end": 1422155, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1422162, "text": "JPMorganChase has in the past incurred significant penalties and experienced collateral consequences and other repercussions in connection with resolving investigations and enforcement actions by governmental authorities, and it could face similar investigations, actions and resolutions in the future. JPMorganChase typically incurs higher operational and compliance costs when addressing the requirements of such resolutions, including devoting substantial resources to remediation."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1422199, "parts": [{"text": "In connection with resolving specific investigations or enforcement actions, certain governmental authorities have required JPMorganChase and other financial institutions to admit wrongdoing with respect to the activities that gave rise to the resolution. These types of admissions could lead to negative consequences such as:", "start": 1422306, "end": 1422632, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1422639, "text": "In connection with resolving specific investigations or enforcement actions, certain governmental authorities have required JPMorganChase and other financial institutions to admit wrongdoing with respect to the activities that gave rise to the resolution. These types of admissions could lead to negative consequences such as:"}
