{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1426807, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase expects that the following trends will continue:", "start": 1426914, "end": 1426976, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1426983, "text": "JPMorganChase expects that the following trends will continue:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1427054, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1427161, "end": 1427168, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1427175, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1427175, "parts": [{"text": "it will be subject to heightened regulatory scrutiny and pervasive investigations and enforcement actions by governmental authorities, as well as criticism or litigation from clients or customers who claim that they have been harmed by actions taken by JPMorganChase in order to comply with applicable law", "start": 1427299, "end": 1427604, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1427611, "text": "it will be subject to heightened regulatory scrutiny and pervasive investigations and enforcement actions by governmental authorities, as well as criticism or litigation from clients or customers who claim that they have been harmed by actions taken by JPMorganChase in order to comply with applicable law"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1427682, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1427789, "end": 1427796, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1427803, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1427803, "parts": [{"text": "governmental authorities will forgo opportunities to resolve investigations with informal supervisory actions, and will pursue formal and punitive enforcement actions with respect to actual or deemed violations of law", "start": 1427927, "end": 1428144, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1428151, "text": "governmental authorities will forgo opportunities to resolve investigations with informal supervisory actions, and will pursue formal and punitive enforcement actions with respect to actual or deemed violations of law"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1428222, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1428329, "end": 1428336, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1428343, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1428343, "parts": [{"text": "resolutions of investigations and enforcement actions will result in the imposition of significant penalties, and", "start": 1428467, "end": 1428580, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1428587, "text": "resolutions of investigations and enforcement actions will result in the imposition of significant penalties, and"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1428658, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1428765, "end": 1428772, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1428779, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1428779, "parts": [{"text": "governmental authorities will be more likely to bring formal enforcement actions against JPMorganChase if it has previously been subject to other investigations or enforcement actions by governmental authorities.", "start": 1428903, "end": 1429115, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1429122, "text": "governmental authorities will be more likely to bring formal enforcement actions against JPMorganChase if it has previously been subject to other investigations or enforcement actions by governmental authorities."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1429159, "parts": [{"text": "When resolving an investigation or enforcement action by a governmental authority, the subject financial institution typically must satisfy new or enhanced regulatory requirements or restrictions. If JPMorganChase fails to meet the requirements of any such resolution, or to maintain risk and control processes that meet the heightened expectations of its regulators, it could be required to, among other things:", "start": 1429266, "end": 1429678, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1429685, "text": "When resolving an investigation or enforcement action by a governmental authority, the subject financial institution typically must satisfy new or enhanced regulatory requirements or restrictions. If JPMorganChase fails to meet the requirements of any such resolution, or to maintain risk and control processes that meet the heightened expectations of its regulators, it could be required to, among other things:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1429756, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1429863, "end": 1429870, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1429877, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1429877, "parts": [{"text": "enter into further resolutions ", "start": 1430001, "end": 1430032, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1430039, "text": "enter into further resolutions"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1430110, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1430217, "end": 1430224, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1430231, "text": "•"}
