{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1430476, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1430583, "end": 1430590, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1430597, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1430597, "parts": [{"text": "accept material restrictions on, or changes in the management of, its businesses.", "start": 1430721, "end": 1430802, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1430809, "text": "accept material restrictions on, or changes in the management of, its businesses."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1430846, "parts": [{"text": "In these circumstances, JPMorganChase could also become subject to prosecution or civil litigation with respect to the matters that gave rise to an investigation or enforcement action. In addition, JPMorganChase could incur higher costs when resolving investigations and enforcement actions involving newly-acquired businesses, companies in which JPMorganChase has made principal investments, parties to joint ventures with JPMorganChase, and vendors with which JPMorganChase does business.", "start": 1430953, "end": 1431443, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1431450, "text": "In these circumstances, JPMorganChase could also become subject to prosecution or civil litigation with respect to the matters that gave rise to an investigation or enforcement action. In addition, JPMorganChase could incur higher costs when resolving investigations and enforcement actions involving newly-acquired businesses, companies in which JPMorganChase has made principal investments, parties to joint ventures with JPMorganChase, and vendors with which JPMorganChase does business."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1431487, "parts": [{"text": "As a participant in the financial services industry, it is likely that JPMorganChase will continue to experience a high level of litigation and investigations by ", "start": 1431594, "end": 1431756, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1431763, "text": "As a participant in the financial services industry, it is likely that JPMorganChase will continue to experience a high level of litigation and investigations by"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1431966, "parts": [{"text": "governmental authorities related to its businesses and operations. In addition, JPMorganChase could become subject to a significant investigation by governmental authorities and be unable to disclose specific information concerning that investigation to the public if such a disclosure would violate JPMorganChase", "start": 1432073, "end": 1432386, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1432386, "end": 1432393, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s obligations under applicable law to maintain confidentiality, even if the resolution of that investigation could have a material adverse effect on JPMorganChase", "start": 1432393, "end": 1432555, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1432555, "end": 1432562, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business, operations, results or financial condition.", "start": 1432562, "end": 1432617, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1432624, "text": "governmental authorities related to its businesses and operations. In addition, JPMorganChase could become subject to a significant investigation by governmental authorities and be unable to disclose specific information concerning that investigation to the public if such a disclosure would violate JPMorganChase’s obligations under applicable law to maintain confidentiality, even if the resolution of that investigation could have a material adverse effect on JPMorganChase’s business, operations, results or financial condition."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1432661, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1432768, "end": 1432781, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1432781, "end": 1432788, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s compliance risk and operating costs could be higher in jurisdictions with less predictable legal, regulatory and judicial frameworks.", "start": 1432788, "end": 1432923, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1432930, "text": "JPMorganChase’s compliance risk and operating costs could be higher in jurisdictions with less predictable legal, regulatory and judicial frameworks."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1432967, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase conducts business in certain jurisdictions in which the application of the rule of law is inconsistent, extralegal or less predictable, including with respect to:", "start": 1433074, "end": 1433250, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1433257, "text": "JPMorganChase conducts business in certain jurisdictions in which the application of the rule of law is inconsistent, extralegal or less predictable, including with respect to:"}
