{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1435675, "parts": [{"text": "the threat of investigations by governmental authorities, civil litigations or criminal prosecutions that are arbitrary or otherwise contrary to established legal principles in other parts of the world, and", "start": 1435799, "end": 1436005, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1436012, "text": "the threat of investigations by governmental authorities, civil litigations or criminal prosecutions that are arbitrary or otherwise contrary to established legal principles in other parts of the world, and"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1436083, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1436190, "end": 1436197, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1436204, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1436204, "parts": [{"text": "the termination of licenses or other permissions required to operate in the relevant jurisdiction, or the suspension of business relationships with governmental entities, leading to lost revenue.", "start": 1436328, "end": 1436523, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1436530, "text": "the termination of licenses or other permissions required to operate in the relevant jurisdiction, or the suspension of business relationships with governmental entities, leading to lost revenue."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1436567, "parts": [{"text": "If the legal, regulatory or judicial framework in a particular jurisdiction is susceptible to producing outcomes that are inconsistent, unexpected or contrary to established legal principles, this could create a more difficult business environment for JPMorganChase and could negatively affect its operations and reduce its earnings with respect to that jurisdiction. In addition, conducting business in a jurisdiction with a less predictable legal, regulatory or judicial framework could require JPMorganChase to devote significant additional resources to understanding, and operating its businesses in compliance with, applicable law and judicial precedents in that jurisdiction, and there can be no assurance that JPMorganChase will always be successful in doing so.", "start": 1436674, "end": 1437443, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1437450, "text": "If the legal, regulatory or judicial framework in a particular jurisdiction is susceptible to producing outcomes that are inconsistent, unexpected or contrary to established legal principles, this could create a more difficult business environment for JPMorganChase and could negatively affect its operations and reduce its earnings with respect to that jurisdiction. In addition, conducting business in a jurisdiction with a less predictable legal, regulatory or judicial framework could require JPMorganChase to devote significant additional resources to understanding, and operating its businesses in compliance with, applicable law and judicial precedents in that jurisdiction, and there can be no assurance that JPMorganChase will always be successful in doing so."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1438022, "parts": [{"text": "12", "start": 1438127, "end": 1438129, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1438136, "text": "12"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1438496, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase's business and operations could be negatively affected by governmental policies that discourage or penalize doing business with certain industries or that require specific business practices.", "start": 1438603, "end": 1438808, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1438815, "text": "JPMorganChase's business and operations could be negatively affected by governmental policies that discourage or penalize doing business with certain industries or that require specific business practices."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1438852, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1438959, "end": 1438972, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1438972, "end": 1438979, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses and results of operations could be adversely affected by actions or initiatives by governmental authorities or officials that:", "start": 1438979, "end": 1439118, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1439125, "text": "JPMorganChase’s businesses and results of operations could be adversely affected by actions or initiatives by governmental authorities or officials that:"}
