{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1468624, "parts": [{"text": "The above factors could be affected by global economic, market and political events and conditions, including the regulatory environment, monetary policies, trade policies, and actions taken by central banks or governmental authorities.", "start": 1468731, "end": 1468967, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1468974, "text": "The above factors could be affected by global economic, market and political events and conditions, including the regulatory environment, monetary policies, trade policies, and actions taken by central banks or governmental authorities."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1469011, "parts": [{"text": "In addition, JPMorganChase", "start": 1469118, "end": 1469144, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1469144, "end": 1469151, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s investment portfolio and market-making businesses could suffer losses due to unanticipated market events and conditions, including:", "start": 1469151, "end": 1469284, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1469291, "text": "In addition, JPMorganChase’s investment portfolio and market-making businesses could suffer losses due to unanticipated market events and conditions, including:"}
