{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1471769, "parts": [{"text": "Any significant losses in JPMorganChase", "start": 1471876, "end": 1471915, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1471915, "end": 1471922, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s investment portfolio or from market-making activities could reduce its profitability and its liquidity and capital levels, and thereby constrain the growth of its businesses.", "start": 1471922, "end": 1472098, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1472105, "text": "Any significant losses in JPMorganChase’s investment portfolio or from market-making activities could reduce its profitability and its liquidity and capital levels, and thereby constrain the growth of its businesses."}
