{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1487093, "parts": [{"text": "All of these outcomes could adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1487200, "end": 1487258, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1487258, "end": 1487265, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s earnings or its liquidity and capital levels, with more severe impacts in a prolonged period of high interest rates.", "start": 1487265, "end": 1487383, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1487390, "text": "All of these outcomes could adversely affect JPMorganChase’s earnings or its liquidity and capital levels, with more severe impacts in a prolonged period of high interest rates."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1487427, "parts": [{"text": "Higher interest rates could also negatively affect the payment performance on loans within JPMorganChase", "start": 1487534, "end": 1487638, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1487638, "end": 1487645, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s consumer and wholesale loan portfolios that are linked to variable interest rates. If borrowers of variable rate loans reduce or stop making payments at higher interest rates, JPMorganChase could incur losses as well as increased operational costs related to servicing a higher volume of delinquent loans. On the other hand, a low or negative interest rate environment could cause:", "start": 1487645, "end": 1488028, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1488035, "text": "Higher interest rates could also negatively affect the payment performance on loans within JPMorganChase’s consumer and wholesale loan portfolios that are linked to variable interest rates. If borrowers of variable rate loans reduce or stop making payments at higher interest rates, JPMorganChase could incur losses as well as increased operational costs related to servicing a higher volume of delinquent loans. On the other hand, a low or negative interest rate environment could cause:"}
