{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1489161, "parts": [{"text": "a reduction in the value of JPMorganChase", "start": 1489285, "end": 1489326, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1489326, "end": 1489333, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s mortgage servicing rights (", "start": 1489333, "end": 1489362, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1489362, "end": 1489369, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "MSRs", "start": 1489369, "end": 1489373, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1489373, "end": 1489380, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": ") asset, resulting in decreased revenues.", "start": 1489380, "end": 1489421, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1489428, "text": "a reduction in the value of JPMorganChase’s mortgage servicing rights (“MSRs”) asset, resulting in decreased revenues."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1489465, "parts": [{"text": "When credit spreads widen, it becomes more expensive for JPMorganChase to borrow.", "start": 1489572, "end": 1489653, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1489660, "text": "When credit spreads widen, it becomes more expensive for JPMorganChase to borrow."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1489697, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1489804, "end": 1489817, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1489817, "end": 1489824, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s credit spreads could widen or narrow not only due to events and circumstances that are specific to JPMorganChase but also as a result of general economic and geopolitical events and conditions. Changes in JPMorganChase", "start": 1489824, "end": 1490044, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1490044, "end": 1490051, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s credit spreads could negatively affect its earnings on certain liabilities, such as derivatives, that are recorded at fair value.", "start": 1490051, "end": 1490182, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1490189, "text": "JPMorganChase’s credit spreads could widen or narrow not only due to events and circumstances that are specific to JPMorganChase but also as a result of general economic and geopolitical events and conditions. Changes in JPMorganChase’s credit spreads could negatively affect its earnings on certain liabilities, such as derivatives, that are recorded at fair value."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1490226, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1490333, "end": 1490346, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1490346, "end": 1490353, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s results could be materially affected by market fluctuations and significant changes in the valuation of financial instruments.", "start": 1490353, "end": 1490481, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1490488, "text": "JPMorganChase’s results could be materially affected by market fluctuations and significant changes in the valuation of financial instruments."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1490525, "parts": [{"text": "The value of securities, derivatives and other financial instruments that JPMorganChase owns or in which it makes markets could be materially affected by market fluctuations. Market volatility, illiquid market conditions and other fluctuations in the financial markets could make it extremely difficult to value certain financial instruments. Subsequent valuations of financial instruments in future periods, in light of factors then prevailing, could result in significant changes in the value of these instruments. In addition, when JPMorganChase disposes of a financial instrument, the price that it realizes will depend on demand and liquidity in the market at the time of disposition, and that price could be materially lower than the current fair ", "start": 1490632, "end": 1491385, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1491392, "text": "The value of securities, derivatives and other financial instruments that JPMorganChase owns or in which it makes markets could be materially affected by market fluctuations. Market volatility, illiquid market conditions and other fluctuations in the financial markets could make it extremely difficult to value certain financial instruments. Subsequent valuations of financial instruments in future periods, in light of factors then prevailing, could result in significant changes in the value of these instruments. In addition, when JPMorganChase disposes of a financial instrument, the price that it realizes will depend on demand and liquidity in the market at the time of disposition, and that price could be materially lower than the current fair"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1491964, "parts": [{"text": "16", "start": 1492069, "end": 1492071, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1492078, "text": "16"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1492438, "parts": [{"text": "value of the instrument. Any of these factors could cause a decline in the value of financial instruments that JPMorganChase owns or in which it makes markets, which could have an adverse effect on its results of operations. Furthermore, JPMorganChase", "start": 1492545, "end": 1492796, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1492796, "end": 1492803, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s hedging and other risk management strategies may not always be effective, and it could incur significant losses, if extreme market events were to occur.", "start": 1492803, "end": 1492957, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1492964, "text": "value of the instrument. Any of these factors could cause a decline in the value of financial instruments that JPMorganChase owns or in which it makes markets, which could have an adverse effect on its results of operations. Furthermore, JPMorganChase’s hedging and other risk management strategies may not always be effective, and it could incur significant losses, if extreme market events were to occur."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#8f5a39;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1493001, "parts": [{"text": "Credit", "start": 1493108, "end": 1493114, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1493121, "text": "Credit"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1493158, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase could be negatively affected by adverse changes in the financial condition of clients, counterparties, CCPs and other market participants.", "start": 1493265, "end": 1493417, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1493424, "text": "JPMorganChase could be negatively affected by adverse changes in the financial condition of clients, counterparties, CCPs and other market participants."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1493461, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase routinely executes transactions with clients and counterparties such as corporations, financial institutions, asset managers, hedge funds, securities exchanges and government entities globally. Many of these transactions expose JPMorganChase to the credit risk of its clients and counterparties, and JPMorganChase could incur losses and become involved in disputes and litigation in connection with a default by a client or counterparty. JPMorganChase could also face losses or liability if a financial institution providing custodial services for client assets becomes insolvent. ", "start": 1493568, "end": 1494163, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1494170, "text": "JPMorganChase routinely executes transactions with clients and counterparties such as corporations, financial institutions, asset managers, hedge funds, securities exchanges and government entities globally. Many of these transactions expose JPMorganChase to the credit risk of its clients and counterparties, and JPMorganChase could incur losses and become involved in disputes and litigation in connection with a default by a client or counterparty. JPMorganChase could also face losses or liability if a financial institution providing custodial services for client assets becomes insolvent."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1494207, "parts": [{"text": "If a CCP through which JPMorganChase executes contracts suffers a financial or operational failure or otherwise defaults, JPMorganChase would be required to replace the relevant contracts, which would increase its operational costs and potentially result in losses. In addition, if a member of a CCP in which JPMorganChase is also a member defaults on its obligations to the CCP, JPMorganChase could incur losses due to requirements that each member of the CCP absorb a portion of those losses. Furthermore, JPMorganChase could be subject to bearing its share of non-default losses incurred by a CCP, including losses from custodial, settlement or investment activities or due to cyber or other security breaches.", "start": 1494314, "end": 1495027, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1495034, "text": "If a CCP through which JPMorganChase executes contracts suffers a financial or operational failure or otherwise defaults, JPMorganChase would be required to replace the relevant contracts, which would increase its operational costs and potentially result in losses. In addition, if a member of a CCP in which JPMorganChase is also a member defaults on its obligations to the CCP, JPMorganChase could incur losses due to requirements that each member of the CCP absorb a portion of those losses. Furthermore, JPMorganChase could be subject to bearing its share of non-default losses incurred by a CCP, including losses from custodial, settlement or investment activities or due to cyber or other security breaches."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1495071, "parts": [{"text": "As part of its clearing services activities, JPMorganChase is exposed to the risk of nonperformance by its clients, which it seeks to mitigate by requiring clients to provide adequate collateral. JPMorganChase is also exposed to intra-day credit risk of its clients in connection with providing cash management, clearing, custodial and other transaction services. If such a client becomes bankrupt or insolvent, JPMorganChase could:", "start": 1495178, "end": 1495610, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1495617, "text": "As part of its clearing services activities, JPMorganChase is exposed to the risk of nonperformance by its clients, which it seeks to mitigate by requiring clients to provide adequate collateral. JPMorganChase is also exposed to intra-day credit risk of its clients in connection with providing cash management, clearing, custodial and other transaction services. If such a client becomes bankrupt or insolvent, JPMorganChase could:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1495688, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1495795, "end": 1495802, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1495809, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1495809, "parts": [{"text": "incur losses", "start": 1495933, "end": 1495945, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1495952, "text": "incur losses"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1496023, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1496130, "end": 1496137, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1496144, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1496144, "parts": [{"text": "become involved in disputes and litigation with CCPs, the client", "start": 1496268, "end": 1496332, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1496332, "end": 1496339, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s bankruptcy estate and other creditors, or ", "start": 1496339, "end": 1496383, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1496390, "text": "become involved in disputes and litigation with CCPs, the client’s bankruptcy estate and other creditors, or"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1496461, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1496568, "end": 1496575, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1496582, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1496582, "parts": [{"text": "be subject to investigations by governmental authorities.", "start": 1496706, "end": 1496763, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1496770, "text": "be subject to investigations by governmental authorities."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1496807, "parts": [{"text": "In addition, JPMorganChase has in the past, and could in the future, experience instances in which borrowers or other counterparties engage in fraudulent activity related to the accounting, reporting or representation ", "start": 1496914, "end": 1497132, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1497139, "text": "In addition, JPMorganChase has in the past, and could in the future, experience instances in which borrowers or other counterparties engage in fraudulent activity related to the accounting, reporting or representation"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1497342, "parts": [{"text": "of collateral. Such practices have resulted and could in the future result in losses for JPMorganChase potentially undermining the effectiveness of collateral requirements and negatively affecting JPMorganChase's financial condition and results of operations. ", "start": 1497449, "end": 1497709, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1497716, "text": "of collateral. Such practices have resulted and could in the future result in losses for JPMorganChase potentially undermining the effectiveness of collateral requirements and negatively affecting JPMorganChase's financial condition and results of operations."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1497753, "parts": [{"text": "All of the foregoing events could increase JPMorganChase", "start": 1497860, "end": 1497916, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1497916, "end": 1497923, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operational and litigation costs, and JPMorganChase could suffer losses to the extent that the realized value of any collateral that it has received is insufficient to cover those losses.", "start": 1497923, "end": 1498112, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1498119, "text": "All of the foregoing events could increase JPMorganChase’s operational and litigation costs, and JPMorganChase could suffer losses to the extent that the realized value of any collateral that it has received is insufficient to cover those losses."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1498156, "parts": [{"text": "Transactions with governmental entities can expose JPMorganChase to enhanced sovereign, credit, operational, legal and reputation risks. Governmental entities may claim that actions taken by government officials were beyond the legal authority of those officials or repudiate transactions authorized by a previous incumbent government. These types of actions have in the past caused, and could in the future cause, JPMorganChase to suffer losses or hamper its ability to conduct business in the relevant jurisdiction. In addition, JPMorganChase could incur losses if applicable law limits its ability to resolve disputes and litigation when a client in that jurisdiction defaults or otherwise fails to make agreed-upon payments.", "start": 1498263, "end": 1498991, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1498998, "text": "Transactions with governmental entities can expose JPMorganChase to enhanced sovereign, credit, operational, legal and reputation risks. Governmental entities may claim that actions taken by government officials were beyond the legal authority of those officials or repudiate transactions authorized by a previous incumbent government. These types of actions have in the past caused, and could in the future cause, JPMorganChase to suffer losses or hamper its ability to conduct business in the relevant jurisdiction. In addition, JPMorganChase could incur losses if applicable law limits its ability to resolve disputes and litigation when a client in that jurisdiction defaults or otherwise fails to make agreed-upon payments."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1499035, "parts": [{"text": "Disputes could arise with counterparties to derivatives contracts concerning the terms, the settlement procedures or the value of underlying collateral. The resolution of those disputes could cause JPMorganChase to incur losses, including unexpected transaction, operational and legal costs. These consequences could also impair JPMorganChase", "start": 1499142, "end": 1499484, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1499484, "end": 1499491, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to effectively manage its credit risk exposure from its market activities, or cause reputational harm.", "start": 1499491, "end": 1499603, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1499610, "text": "Disputes could arise with counterparties to derivatives contracts concerning the terms, the settlement procedures or the value of underlying collateral. The resolution of those disputes could cause JPMorganChase to incur losses, including unexpected transaction, operational and legal costs. These consequences could also impair JPMorganChase’s ability to effectively manage its credit risk exposure from its market activities, or cause reputational harm."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1499647, "parts": [{"text": "The financial or operational failure of a significant market participant, such as a major financial institution or a CCP, or concerns about the creditworthiness or operational sustainability of one or more market participants, could cause substantial and cascading disruption within the financial markets, including in circumstances where coordinated action by multiple other market participants is required to address the problem. JPMorganChase", "start": 1499754, "end": 1500199, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1500199, "end": 1500206, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses could be significantly disrupted by such an event, especially if it has significant interrelationships with, and credit exposure to, the faltering market participant, or if the event causes other market participants to default, incur significant losses or experience liquidity issues.", "start": 1500206, "end": 1500503, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1500510, "text": "The financial or operational failure of a significant market participant, such as a major financial institution or a CCP, or concerns about the creditworthiness or operational sustainability of one or more market participants, could cause substantial and cascading disruption within the financial markets, including in circumstances where coordinated action by multiple other market participants is required to address the problem. JPMorganChase’s businesses could be significantly disrupted by such an event, especially if it has significant interrelationships with, and credit exposure to, the faltering market participant, or if the event causes other market participants to default, incur significant losses or experience liquidity issues."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1500547, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase could suffer losses if the value of collateral declines.", "start": 1500654, "end": 1500724, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1500731, "text": "JPMorganChase could suffer losses if the value of collateral declines."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1500768, "parts": [{"text": "During periods of market stress or illiquidity, JPMorganChase", "start": 1500875, "end": 1500936, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1500936, "end": 1500943, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s credit risk could increase when:", "start": 1500943, "end": 1500977, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1500984, "text": "During periods of market stress or illiquidity, JPMorganChase’s credit risk could increase when:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1501055, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1501162, "end": 1501169, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1501176, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1501176, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase fails to realize the estimated value of the collateral it holds", "start": 1501300, "end": 1501377, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1501384, "text": "JPMorganChase fails to realize the estimated value of the collateral it holds"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1501455, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1501562, "end": 1501569, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1501576, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1501576, "parts": [{"text": "collateral is liquidated at prices that are insufficient to recover the full amount owed to it, or", "start": 1501700, "end": 1501798, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1501805, "text": "collateral is liquidated at prices that are insufficient to recover the full amount owed to it, or"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1502505, "parts": [{"text": "17", "start": 1502610, "end": 1502612, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1502619, "text": "17"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1502745, "parts": [{"text": "Part I", "start": 1502851, "end": 1502857, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1502864, "text": "Part I"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1503036, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1503143, "end": 1503150, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1503157, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1503157, "parts": [{"text": "counterparties are unable to post collateral for operational or other reasons.", "start": 1503281, "end": 1503359, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1503366, "text": "counterparties are unable to post collateral for operational or other reasons."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1503403, "parts": [{"text": "Furthermore, borrowers may under-maintain or misrepresent the condition or existence of collateral, or at liquidation, collateral could be subject to competing claims, limiting JPMorganChase's ability to recover amounts owed, or disputes with counterparties concerning the valuation of collateral could increase during significant market stress, volatility or illiquidity. JPMorganChase could suffer losses in these situations if it is unable to realize the fair value of collateral or to manage declines in the value of collateral.", "start": 1503510, "end": 1504042, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1504049, "text": "Furthermore, borrowers may under-maintain or misrepresent the condition or existence of collateral, or at liquidation, collateral could be subject to competing claims, limiting JPMorganChase's ability to recover amounts owed, or disputes with counterparties concerning the valuation of collateral could increase during significant market stress, volatility or illiquidity. JPMorganChase could suffer losses in these situations if it is unable to realize the fair value of collateral or to manage declines in the value of collateral."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1504086, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase could incur significant losses arising from concentrations of credit and market risk.", "start": 1504193, "end": 1504292, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1504299, "text": "JPMorganChase could incur significant losses arising from concentrations of credit and market risk."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1504336, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase could be exposed to greater credit and market risk if groupings of its clients or counterparties, or obligors on securities and other financial instruments:", "start": 1504443, "end": 1504613, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1504620, "text": "JPMorganChase could be exposed to greater credit and market risk if groupings of its clients or counterparties, or obligors on securities and other financial instruments:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1504691, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1504798, "end": 1504805, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1504812, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1504812, "parts": [{"text": "engage in similar or related businesses or in related industries", "start": 1504936, "end": 1505000, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1505007, "text": "engage in similar or related businesses or in related industries"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1505078, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1505185, "end": 1505192, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1505199, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1505199, "parts": [{"text": "operate in the same geographic region, or", "start": 1505323, "end": 1505364, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1505371, "text": "operate in the same geographic region, or"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1505442, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1505549, "end": 1505556, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1505563, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1505563, "parts": [{"text": "have business profiles that could cause their ability to meet their obligations to be similarly affected by changes in economic conditions.", "start": 1505687, "end": 1505826, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1505833, "text": "have business profiles that could cause their ability to meet their obligations to be similarly affected by changes in economic conditions."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1505870, "parts": [{"text": "For example, a significant deterioration in the credit quality of a counterparty, borrower or other obligor could lead to concerns about the creditworthiness of other parties in similar, related or dependent industries. This type of interrelationship could exacerbate JPMorganChase", "start": 1505977, "end": 1506258, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1506258, "end": 1506265, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s credit, liquidity and market risk exposure, potentially causing losses. In addition, JPMorganChase could be required to increase the allowance for credit losses or establish other reserves with respect to certain clients, industries or country exposures in order to align with regulatory directives or expectations.", "start": 1506265, "end": 1506582, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1506589, "text": "For example, a significant deterioration in the credit quality of a counterparty, borrower or other obligor could lead to concerns about the creditworthiness of other parties in similar, related or dependent industries. This type of interrelationship could exacerbate JPMorganChase’s credit, liquidity and market risk exposure, potentially causing losses. In addition, JPMorganChase could be required to increase the allowance for credit losses or establish other reserves with respect to certain clients, industries or country exposures in order to align with regulatory directives or expectations."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1506626, "parts": [{"text": "Similarly, challenging economic conditions that affect a particular industry or geographic area could lead to concerns about the credit quality of counterparties, borrowers or other obligors not only in that industry or geography but also in related or dependent industries, wherever located. These conditions could also heighten concerns about the ability of customers of JPMorganChase", "start": 1506733, "end": 1507119, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1507119, "end": 1507126, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s consumer businesses who live in those areas or work in those industries to meet their obligations.", "start": 1507126, "end": 1507226, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1507233, "text": "Similarly, challenging economic conditions that affect a particular industry or geographic area could lead to concerns about the credit quality of counterparties, borrowers or other obligors not only in that industry or geography but also in related or dependent industries, wherever located. These conditions could also heighten concerns about the ability of customers of JPMorganChase’s consumer businesses who live in those areas or work in those industries to meet their obligations."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1507270, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1507377, "end": 1507390, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1507390, "end": 1507397, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s consumer businesses could also be harmed by an excessive expansion of consumer credit by competitors. Heightened competition for certain types of consumer loans could lead to significant price reductions for those loans or providing loans to less-creditworthy borrowers. If large numbers of consumers subsequently default on their loans, this could impair their ability to repay obligations owed to JPMorganChase and result in an increase in the allowance for credit losses and higher charge-offs. ", "start": 1507397, "end": 1507897, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1507904, "text": "JPMorganChase’s consumer businesses could also be harmed by an excessive expansion of consumer credit by competitors. Heightened competition for certain types of consumer loans could lead to significant price reductions for those loans or providing loans to less-creditworthy borrowers. If large numbers of consumers subsequently default on their loans, this could impair their ability to repay obligations owed to JPMorganChase and result in an increase in the allowance for credit losses and higher charge-offs."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1508107, "parts": [{"text": "More broadly, widespread defaults on consumer debt could lead to recessionary conditions in the U.S. economy, and JPMorganChase", "start": 1508214, "end": 1508341, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1508341, "end": 1508348, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s consumer businesses could earn lower revenues in such an environment.", "start": 1508348, "end": 1508419, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1508426, "text": "More broadly, widespread defaults on consumer debt could lead to recessionary conditions in the U.S. economy, and JPMorganChase’s consumer businesses could earn lower revenues in such an environment."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1508463, "parts": [{"text": "Furthermore, the interconnectivity across credit markets increases the risk that the significant expansion of private credit could worsen losses among non-bank lenders and their borrowers, particularly if stress or defaults spread to broader funding and credit markets. Such developments could impair asset valuations, reduce market-wide liquidity, disrupt borrowers", "start": 1508570, "end": 1508936, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1508936, "end": 1508943, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": " ability to refinance, and increase default rates, especially if non-bank lenders have weaker underwriting standards, loans are less liquid, or transparency is limited. These outcomes could adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1508943, "end": 1509163, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1509163, "end": 1509170, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s results of operations and lead to losses on market-making positions in its wholesale businesses. ", "start": 1509170, "end": 1509269, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1509276, "text": "Furthermore, the interconnectivity across credit markets increases the risk that the significant expansion of private credit could worsen losses among non-bank lenders and their borrowers, particularly if stress or defaults spread to broader funding and credit markets. Such developments could impair asset valuations, reduce market-wide liquidity, disrupt borrowers’ ability to refinance, and increase default rates, especially if non-bank lenders have weaker underwriting standards, loans are less liquid, or transparency is limited. These outcomes could adversely affect JPMorganChase’s results of operations and lead to losses on market-making positions in its wholesale businesses."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1509313, "parts": [{"text": "If JPMorganChase is unable to reduce positions effectively during a market dislocation, this could increase both the market and credit risks associated with those positions and the level of risk-weighted-assets (", "start": 1509420, "end": 1509632, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1509632, "end": 1509639, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "RWA", "start": 1509639, "end": 1509642, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1509642, "end": 1509649, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": ") that JPMorganChase holds on its balance sheet. These factors could adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1509649, "end": 1509748, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1509748, "end": 1509755, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s capital position, funding costs and the profitability of its businesses.", "start": 1509755, "end": 1509829, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1509836, "text": "If JPMorganChase is unable to reduce positions effectively during a market dislocation, this could increase both the market and credit risks associated with those positions and the level of risk-weighted-assets (“RWA”) that JPMorganChase holds on its balance sheet. These factors could adversely affect JPMorganChase’s capital position, funding costs and the profitability of its businesses."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#8f5a39;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1509873, "parts": [{"text": "Liquidity", "start": 1509980, "end": 1509989, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1509996, "text": "Liquidity"}
