{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1514142, "parts": [{"text": "A reduction in JPMorganChase", "start": 1514249, "end": 1514277, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1514277, "end": 1514284, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s liquidity could be caused by events beyond its control. For example, JPMorganChase", "start": 1514284, "end": 1514368, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1514368, "end": 1514375, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s funding costs could increase and its access to traditional sources of liquidity could be ", "start": 1514375, "end": 1514466, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1514473, "text": "A reduction in JPMorganChase’s liquidity could be caused by events beyond its control. For example, JPMorganChase’s funding costs could increase and its access to traditional sources of liquidity could be"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1515045, "parts": [{"text": "18", "start": 1515150, "end": 1515152, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1515159, "text": "18"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1515519, "parts": [{"text": "limited during periods of market stress, low investor confidence or significant market illiquidity.", "start": 1515626, "end": 1515725, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1515732, "text": "limited during periods of market stress, low investor confidence or significant market illiquidity."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1515769, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase may need to raise funding from alternative sources if its access to stable and lower-cost funding, such as deposits and borrowings from Federal Home Loan Banks, is reduced. Alternative funding could be more expensive or limited. JPMorganChase", "start": 1515876, "end": 1516132, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1516132, "end": 1516139, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s funding costs could also be negatively affected by actions that it may take in order to satisfy regulatory requirements, including those relating to:", "start": 1516139, "end": 1516290, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1516297, "text": "JPMorganChase may need to raise funding from alternative sources if its access to stable and lower-cost funding, such as deposits and borrowings from Federal Home Loan Banks, is reduced. Alternative funding could be more expensive or limited. JPMorganChase’s funding costs could also be negatively affected by actions that it may take in order to satisfy regulatory requirements, including those relating to:"}
