{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1517179, "parts": [{"text": "the pre-positioning of liquidity in certain subsidiaries outside the U.S.", "start": 1517303, "end": 1517376, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1517383, "text": "the pre-positioning of liquidity in certain subsidiaries outside the U.S."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1517420, "parts": [{"text": "More generally, if JPMorganChase fails to effectively manage its liquidity, this could constrain its ability to fund or invest in its businesses and subsidiaries, and thereby adversely affect its results of operations.", "start": 1517527, "end": 1517745, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1517752, "text": "More generally, if JPMorganChase fails to effectively manage its liquidity, this could constrain its ability to fund or invest in its businesses and subsidiaries, and thereby adversely affect its results of operations."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1517789, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorgan Chase ", "start": 1517896, "end": 1517911, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&amp;", "start": 1517911, "end": 1517916, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": " Co. is a holding company and depends on its subsidiaries for funding to make payments on its outstanding securities.", "start": 1517916, "end": 1518033, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1518040, "text": "JPMorgan Chase & Co. is a holding company and depends on its subsidiaries for funding to make payments on its outstanding securities."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1518077, "parts": [{"text": "The Parent Company, JPMorgan Chase ", "start": 1518184, "end": 1518219, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&amp;", "start": 1518219, "end": 1518224, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": " Co., is a holding company that holds the stock of JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. and an intermediate holding company, JPMorgan Chase Holdings LLC (the ", "start": 1518224, "end": 1518371, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1518371, "end": 1518378, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "IHC", "start": 1518378, "end": 1518381, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1518381, "end": 1518388, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "). In addition to holding the stock of other JPMorganChase subsidiaries, the IHC owns other assets and provides intercompany lending to the Parent Company. The Parent Company must contribute to the IHC substantially all the net proceeds that it receives from securities issuances.", "start": 1518388, "end": 1518668, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1518675, "text": "The Parent Company, JPMorgan Chase & Co., is a holding company that holds the stock of JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. and an intermediate holding company, JPMorgan Chase Holdings LLC (the “IHC”). In addition to holding the stock of other JPMorganChase subsidiaries, the IHC owns other assets and provides intercompany lending to the Parent Company. The Parent Company must contribute to the IHC substantially all the net proceeds that it receives from securities issuances."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1518712, "parts": [{"text": "The ability of JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. and the IHC to make payments to the Parent Company is limited. JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. is subject to regulatory restrictions and requirements relating to the dividends that it can pay to the Parent Company, and the IHC is prohibited from paying dividends or extending credit to the Parent Company if certain capital or liquidity thresholds are breached, or if limits are otherwise imposed by the Parent Company", "start": 1518819, "end": 1519272, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1519272, "end": 1519279, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s management or Board of Directors.", "start": 1519279, "end": 1519314, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1519321, "text": "The ability of JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. and the IHC to make payments to the Parent Company is limited. JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. is subject to regulatory restrictions and requirements relating to the dividends that it can pay to the Parent Company, and the IHC is prohibited from paying dividends or extending credit to the Parent Company if certain capital or liquidity thresholds are breached, or if limits are otherwise imposed by the Parent Company’s management or Board of Directors."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1519358, "parts": [{"text": "As a result of these arrangements, the Parent Company is generally dependent on receiving dividends from JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. and dividends and borrowings from the IHC in order to:", "start": 1519465, "end": 1519650, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1519657, "text": "As a result of these arrangements, the Parent Company is generally dependent on receiving dividends from JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. and dividends and borrowings from the IHC in order to:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1519728, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1519835, "end": 1519842, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1519849, "text": "•"}
