{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1525040, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase has experienced credit ratings downgrades in the past, and there is no assurance that JPMorganChase", "start": 1525147, "end": 1525260, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1525260, "end": 1525267, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s credit ratings will not be downgraded in the future. Furthermore, any such downgrade could occur at a time of broader market instability, limiting JPMorganChase", "start": 1525267, "end": 1525429, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1525429, "end": 1525436, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s options for responding.", "start": 1525436, "end": 1525461, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1525468, "text": "JPMorganChase has experienced credit ratings downgrades in the past, and there is no assurance that JPMorganChase’s credit ratings will not be downgraded in the future. Furthermore, any such downgrade could occur at a time of broader market instability, limiting JPMorganChase’s options for responding."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1525505, "parts": [{"text": "A downgrade in JPMorganChase", "start": 1525612, "end": 1525640, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1525640, "end": 1525647, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s credit ratings could curtail its business activities and its profitability, including by:", "start": 1525647, "end": 1525738, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1525745, "text": "A downgrade in JPMorganChase’s credit ratings could curtail its business activities and its profitability, including by:"}
