{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1527071, "parts": [{"text": "decreasing the number of investors and counterparties that are willing or permitted to do business with or lend to JPMorganChase.", "start": 1527195, "end": 1527324, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1527331, "text": "decreasing the number of investors and counterparties that are willing or permitted to do business with or lend to JPMorganChase."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1527368, "parts": [{"text": "Any rating downgrade could also increase the credit spreads charged by market participants for taking credit risk on JPMorgan Chase ", "start": 1527475, "end": 1527607, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&amp;", "start": 1527607, "end": 1527612, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": " Co. and its subsidiaries. This could, in turn, adversely affect the value of debt and other obligations of JPMorgan Chase ", "start": 1527612, "end": 1527735, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&amp;", "start": 1527735, "end": 1527740, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": " Co. and its subsidiaries.", "start": 1527740, "end": 1527766, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1527773, "text": "Any rating downgrade could also increase the credit spreads charged by market participants for taking credit risk on JPMorgan Chase & Co. and its subsidiaries. This could, in turn, adversely affect the value of debt and other obligations of JPMorgan Chase & Co. and its subsidiaries."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#8f5a39;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1527810, "parts": [{"text": "Capital", "start": 1527917, "end": 1527924, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1527931, "text": "Capital"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1527968, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1528075, "end": 1528088, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1528088, "end": 1528095, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to distribute capital to shareholders, and to support its business activities could be limited if it does not satisfy applicable regulatory capital requirements.", "start": 1528095, "end": 1528266, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1528273, "text": "JPMorganChase’s ability to distribute capital to shareholders, and to support its business activities could be limited if it does not satisfy applicable regulatory capital requirements."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1528310, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase is subject to various regulatory capital requirements, and the amount of capital that it is required to hold under those requirements could increase at any given time due to factors such as:", "start": 1528417, "end": 1528621, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1528628, "text": "JPMorganChase is subject to various regulatory capital requirements, and the amount of capital that it is required to hold under those requirements could increase at any given time due to factors such as:"}
