{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1530429, "parts": [{"text": "changes in the composition of JPMorganChase", "start": 1530553, "end": 1530596, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1530596, "end": 1530603, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s balance sheet or developments that could increase RWA, such as increased market risk, customer delinquencies, client credit rating downgrades or other factors, and", "start": 1530603, "end": 1530768, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1530775, "text": "changes in the composition of JPMorganChase’s balance sheet or developments that could increase RWA, such as increased market risk, customer delinquencies, client credit rating downgrades or other factors, and"}
