{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1530967, "parts": [{"text": "increases in estimated stress losses as determined by the Federal Reserve under CCAR, which could increase JPMorganChase", "start": 1531091, "end": 1531211, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1531211, "end": 1531218, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s SCB.", "start": 1531218, "end": 1531224, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1531231, "text": "increases in estimated stress losses as determined by the Federal Reserve under CCAR, which could increase JPMorganChase’s SCB."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1531268, "parts": [{"text": "Although more likely in times of stress, JPMorganChase may use its regulatory capital buffers allowing capital ratios to decline below regulatory requirements, subjecting it to restrictions on capital distributions and discretionary bonus payments to its executive officers.", "start": 1531375, "end": 1531649, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1531656, "text": "Although more likely in times of stress, JPMorganChase may use its regulatory capital buffers allowing capital ratios to decline below regulatory requirements, subjecting it to restrictions on capital distributions and discretionary bonus payments to its executive officers."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1531693, "parts": [{"text": "Any failure by or inability of JPMorganChase to maintain the required level and composition of capital, any decision by JPMorgan Chase to use its regulatory buffers allowing capital ratios to decline below regulatory requirements or unfavorable changes in applicable capital requirements, could have an adverse impact on JPMorganChase", "start": 1531800, "end": 1532134, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1532134, "end": 1532141, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s shareholders by:", "start": 1532141, "end": 1532159, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1532166, "text": "Any failure by or inability of JPMorganChase to maintain the required level and composition of capital, any decision by JPMorgan Chase to use its regulatory buffers allowing capital ratios to decline below regulatory requirements or unfavorable changes in applicable capital requirements, could have an adverse impact on JPMorganChase’s shareholders by:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1532237, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1532344, "end": 1532351, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1532358, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1532358, "parts": [{"text": "reducing the amount of common stock that JPMorganChase is permitted to repurchase", "start": 1532482, "end": 1532563, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1532570, "text": "reducing the amount of common stock that JPMorganChase is permitted to repurchase"}
