{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1553472, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1553579, "end": 1553592, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1553592, "end": 1553599, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s interconnectedness with clients, customers and other external parties could be a source of significant operational risk.", "start": 1553599, "end": 1553721, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1553728, "text": "JPMorganChase’s interconnectedness with clients, customers and other external parties could be a source of significant operational risk."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1553765, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase could be exposed to operational risk if it is unable to access and use external operational systems, including during failures or cyber attacks related to those systems or other third-party systems. Similarly, retailers, payment systems and processors, data aggregators, and other external parties with which JPMorganChase", "start": 1553872, "end": 1554208, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1554208, "end": 1554215, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s customers do business could increase JPMorganChase", "start": 1554215, "end": 1554267, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1554267, "end": 1554274, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operational risk. This is particularly the case where activities of customers or other parties are beyond JPMorganChase", "start": 1554274, "end": 1554395, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1554395, "end": 1554402, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s security and control systems, including through the use of the internet, cloud computing services, and mobile devices or services.", "start": 1554402, "end": 1554534, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1554541, "text": "JPMorganChase could be exposed to operational risk if it is unable to access and use external operational systems, including during failures or cyber attacks related to those systems or other third-party systems. Similarly, retailers, payment systems and processors, data aggregators, and other external parties with which JPMorganChase’s customers do business could increase JPMorganChase’s operational risk. This is particularly the case where activities of customers or other parties are beyond JPMorganChase’s security and control systems, including through the use of the internet, cloud computing services, and mobile devices or services."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1554578, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1554685, "end": 1554698, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1554698, "end": 1554705, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s interconnectivity with clients, customers and other external parties continues to expand, which increases the risk of failure or cyber attacks with respect to the systems of those parties. Any systems failure, security breach, or human error or misconduct that affects clients, customers or external parties could require JPMorganChase to take steps to protect the integrity of its own operational systems or to safeguard confidential information, including restricting the access of its customers to their accounts. These actions could increase JPMorganChase", "start": 1554705, "end": 1555266, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1555266, "end": 1555273, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operational costs and potentially diminish customer satisfaction and confidence in JPMorganChase.", "start": 1555273, "end": 1555372, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1555379, "text": "JPMorganChase’s interconnectivity with clients, customers and other external parties continues to expand, which increases the risk of failure or cyber attacks with respect to the systems of those parties. Any systems failure, security breach, or human error or misconduct that affects clients, customers or external parties could require JPMorganChase to take steps to protect the integrity of its own operational systems or to safeguard confidential information, including restricting the access of its customers to their accounts. These actions could increase JPMorganChase’s operational costs and potentially diminish customer satisfaction and confidence in JPMorganChase."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1555416, "parts": [{"text": "Furthermore, the widespread interconnectivity among financial institutions, clearing banks, CCPs, payments processors, financial technology companies, securities exchanges, clearing houses, financial messaging networks and other financial market infrastructures increases the risk that the disruption of an operational system involving one entity could cause industry-wide operational disruptions that could materially affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1555523, "end": 1555962, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1555962, "end": 1555969, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to conduct business. In addition, the risks associated with the disruption of an operational system of a third-party could be exacerbated if the services provided by that system are widely used by market participants.", "start": 1555969, "end": 1556196, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1556203, "text": "Furthermore, the widespread interconnectivity among financial institutions, clearing banks, CCPs, payments processors, financial technology companies, securities exchanges, clearing houses, financial messaging networks and other financial market infrastructures increases the risk that the disruption of an operational system involving one entity could cause industry-wide operational disruptions that could materially affect JPMorganChase’s ability to conduct business. In addition, the risks associated with the disruption of an operational system of a third-party could be exacerbated if the services provided by that system are widely used by market participants."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1556240, "parts": [{"text": "A successful cyber attack could cause significant harm to JPMorganChase and its clients and customers.", "start": 1556347, "end": 1556449, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1556456, "text": "A successful cyber attack could cause significant harm to JPMorganChase and its clients and customers."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1556493, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase experiences numerous cyber attacks on its computer systems, software, networks and other technology assets. Cyber attacks could take many forms, and may be designed to:", "start": 1556600, "end": 1556782, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1556789, "text": "JPMorganChase experiences numerous cyber attacks on its computer systems, software, networks and other technology assets. Cyber attacks could take many forms, and may be designed to:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1556860, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1556967, "end": 1556974, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1556981, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1556981, "parts": [{"text": "introduce computer viruses or malicious code (i.e., ", "start": 1557105, "end": 1557157, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1557157, "end": 1557164, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "malware", "start": 1557164, "end": 1557171, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1557171, "end": 1557178, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": ") into JPMorganChase", "start": 1557178, "end": 1557198, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1557198, "end": 1557205, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s systems.", "start": 1557205, "end": 1557215, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1557222, "text": "introduce computer viruses or malicious code (i.e., “malware”) into JPMorganChase’s systems."}
