{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1588372, "parts": [{"text": "and to maintain an effective risk management framework is highly dependent on its ability to staff its operations appropriately and on the competence, trustworthiness, health and safety of its employees. JPMorganChase", "start": 1588479, "end": 1588696, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1588696, "end": 1588703, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses and operations similarly rely on the workforces of third parties, including employees of vendors, custodians and financial markets infrastructures, and of businesses that it may seek to acquire.", "start": 1588703, "end": 1588910, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1588917, "text": "and to maintain an effective risk management framework is highly dependent on its ability to staff its operations appropriately and on the competence, trustworthiness, health and safety of its employees. JPMorganChase’s businesses and operations similarly rely on the workforces of third parties, including employees of vendors, custodians and financial markets infrastructures, and of businesses that it may seek to acquire."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1588954, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1589061, "end": 1589074, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1589074, "end": 1589081, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses could be materially and adversely affected by:", "start": 1589081, "end": 1589140, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1589147, "text": "JPMorganChase’s businesses could be materially and adversely affected by:"}
