{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1590125, "parts": [{"text": "the possibility that significant portions of JPMorganChase", "start": 1590249, "end": 1590307, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1590307, "end": 1590314, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s workforce are unable to work effectively, including due to health emergencies or other extraordinary events beyond JPMorganChase", "start": 1590314, "end": 1590444, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1590444, "end": 1590451, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s control", "start": 1590451, "end": 1590460, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1590467, "text": "the possibility that significant portions of JPMorganChase’s workforce are unable to work effectively, including due to health emergencies or other extraordinary events beyond JPMorganChase’s control"}
