{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1591037, "parts": [{"text": "other negative outcomes caused by human error or misconduct", "start": 1591161, "end": 1591220, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1591227, "text": "other negative outcomes caused by human error or misconduct"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1591264, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1591371, "end": 1591384, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1591384, "end": 1591391, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operations could also be impaired if the measures that it takes to protect the health and safety of employees, or actions taken by governmental authorities or other external parties on which it relies are ineffective.  ", "start": 1591391, "end": 1591612, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1591619, "text": "JPMorganChase’s operations could also be impaired if the measures that it takes to protect the health and safety of employees, or actions taken by governmental authorities or other external parties on which it relies are ineffective."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1591656, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase faces substantial legal and operational risks related to the processing and safeguarding of personal information.", "start": 1591763, "end": 1591890, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1591897, "text": "JPMorganChase faces substantial legal and operational risks related to the processing and safeguarding of personal information."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1591934, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1592041, "end": 1592054, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1592054, "end": 1592061, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses and operations are subject to applicable law globally related to the collection, use, sharing, storage and protection of personal information of individuals. Complying with these applicable laws could:", "start": 1592061, "end": 1592275, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1592282, "text": "JPMorganChase’s businesses and operations are subject to applicable law globally related to the collection, use, sharing, storage and protection of personal information of individuals. Complying with these applicable laws could:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1592353, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1592460, "end": 1592467, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1592474, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1592474, "parts": [{"text": "hinder development, curtail offerings or affect pricing and delivery methods of products and services ", "start": 1592598, "end": 1592700, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1592707, "text": "hinder development, curtail offerings or affect pricing and delivery methods of products and services"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1592778, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1592885, "end": 1592892, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1592899, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1592899, "parts": [{"text": "restrict JPMorganChase from transferring information across national borders or sharing information among affiliates or with third parties such as vendors, thereby increasing compliance costs and operational risk", "start": 1593023, "end": 1593235, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1593242, "text": "restrict JPMorganChase from transferring information across national borders or sharing information among affiliates or with third parties such as vendors, thereby increasing compliance costs and operational risk"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1593313, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1593420, "end": 1593427, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1593434, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1593434, "parts": [{"text": "present situations where the applicable law of one country conflicts with that of another, and", "start": 1593558, "end": 1593652, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1593659, "text": "present situations where the applicable law of one country conflicts with that of another, and"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1593730, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1593837, "end": 1593844, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1593851, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1593851, "parts": [{"text": "require JPMorganChase to structure its businesses, operations and systems in less efficient or more costly ways, including with respect to the local storage and processing of data.", "start": 1593975, "end": 1594155, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1594162, "text": "require JPMorganChase to structure its businesses, operations and systems in less efficient or more costly ways, including with respect to the local storage and processing of data."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1594199, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase could face legal proceedings, including governmental investigations or enforcement actions, if personal information is mishandled, including if unauthorized parties receive, intercept, or compromise it, if JPMorganChase fails or is perceived ", "start": 1594306, "end": 1594562, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1594569, "text": "JPMorganChase could face legal proceedings, including governmental investigations or enforcement actions, if personal information is mishandled, including if unauthorized parties receive, intercept, or compromise it, if JPMorganChase fails or is perceived"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1594772, "parts": [{"text": "to have failed to comply with applicable law, or if JPMorganChase or its third-party vendors fail to protect personal information appropriately. These actions could require JPMorganChase to modify or cease operations or could result in other penalties. Furthermore, concerns regarding the effectiveness of JPMorganChase", "start": 1594879, "end": 1595198, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1595198, "end": 1595205, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s measures to safeguard personal information, or the perception that those measures are inadequate, could cause JPMorganChase to lose clients, customers or employees, and thereby reduce JPMorganChase", "start": 1595205, "end": 1595404, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1595404, "end": 1595411, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s revenues. Any of these factors could cause reputational harm and otherwise adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1595411, "end": 1595518, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1595518, "end": 1595525, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses.", "start": 1595525, "end": 1595538, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1595545, "text": "to have failed to comply with applicable law, or if JPMorganChase or its third-party vendors fail to protect personal information appropriately. These actions could require JPMorganChase to modify or cease operations or could result in other penalties. Furthermore, concerns regarding the effectiveness of JPMorganChase’s measures to safeguard personal information, or the perception that those measures are inadequate, could cause JPMorganChase to lose clients, customers or employees, and thereby reduce JPMorganChase’s revenues. Any of these factors could cause reputational harm and otherwise adversely affect JPMorganChase’s businesses."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1595582, "parts": [{"text": "The growing sophistication of technology poses a heightened risk of identity fraud, as malicious actors may exploit technology to create convincing false identities or manipulate verification processes. Failure to manage these risks or to implement effective countermeasures could lead to unauthorized transactions, financial losses, increased regulatory scrutiny and reputational harm. In addition, greater government scrutiny of practices related to the handling of personal information has in some cases resulted in, and could in the future lead to, the adoption of applicable law in the U.S. and elsewhere that is stricter and could result in JPMorganChase incurring higher compliance costs or constraining its ability to offer certain products and services to customers. ", "start": 1595689, "end": 1596465, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1596472, "text": "The growing sophistication of technology poses a heightened risk of identity fraud, as malicious actors may exploit technology to create convincing false identities or manipulate verification processes. Failure to manage these risks or to implement effective countermeasures could lead to unauthorized transactions, financial losses, increased regulatory scrutiny and reputational harm. In addition, greater government scrutiny of practices related to the handling of personal information has in some cases resulted in, and could in the future lead to, the adoption of applicable law in the U.S. and elsewhere that is stricter and could result in JPMorganChase incurring higher compliance costs or constraining its ability to offer certain products and services to customers."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1596509, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1596616, "end": 1596629, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1596629, "end": 1596636, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operations, results and reputation could be harmed by occurrences of extraordinary events beyond its control.", "start": 1596636, "end": 1596747, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1596754, "text": "JPMorganChase’s operations, results and reputation could be harmed by occurrences of extraordinary events beyond its control."}
