{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1603099, "parts": [{"text": "There can be no assurance that JPMorganChase", "start": 1603206, "end": 1603250, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1603250, "end": 1603257, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s Firmwide resiliency framework will mitigate all potential resiliency risks to JPMorganChase, its clients and customers, and the third parties, including service providers with which it does business, or that the resiliency framework will be able to anticipate or defend against every form of disruption or adequately address the effects of simultaneous or prolonged disruptions. In addition, JPMorganChase", "start": 1603257, "end": 1603664, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1603664, "end": 1603671, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to respond effectively to a disruption event could be hampered to the extent that the members of its workforce, physical assets, systems and other support infrastructure, or those of its third-party service providers, that are needed to address the event are geographically dispersed, or conversely, if such an event were to occur in an area in which they are concentrated. Further, should extraordinary events or the factors that cause or contribute to those events become more chronic, the disruptive effects of those events on JPMorganChase", "start": 1603671, "end": 1604224, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1604224, "end": 1604231, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business and operations, and on its clients, customers, counterparties and employees, could become more significant and persistent.", "start": 1604231, "end": 1604364, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1604371, "text": "There can be no assurance that JPMorganChase’s Firmwide resiliency framework will mitigate all potential resiliency risks to JPMorganChase, its clients and customers, and the third parties, including service providers with which it does business, or that the resiliency framework will be able to anticipate or defend against every form of disruption or adequately address the effects of simultaneous or prolonged disruptions. In addition, JPMorganChase’s ability to respond effectively to a disruption event could be hampered to the extent that the members of its workforce, physical assets, systems and other support infrastructure, or those of its third-party service providers, that are needed to address the event are geographically dispersed, or conversely, if such an event were to occur in an area in which they are concentrated. Further, should extraordinary events or the factors that cause or contribute to those events become more chronic, the disruptive effects of those events on JPMorganChase’s business and operations, and on its clients, customers, counterparties and employees, could become more significant and persistent."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1604408, "parts": [{"text": "Any significant failure or disruption of JPMorganChase", "start": 1604515, "end": 1604569, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1604569, "end": 1604576, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business and operations, or the occurrence of extraordinary events that are beyond its control, could:", "start": 1604576, "end": 1604680, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1604687, "text": "Any significant failure or disruption of JPMorganChase’s business and operations, or the occurrence of extraordinary events that are beyond its control, could:"}
