{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1607139, "parts": [{"text": "The occurrence of extraordinary events could also negatively impact the financial condition or creditworthiness of JPMorganChase", "start": 1607246, "end": 1607374, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1607374, "end": 1607381, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s clients and customers, and could lead to an increase in the allowance for credit losses and higher net charge-offs, which could reduce JPMorganChase", "start": 1607381, "end": 1607531, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1607531, "end": 1607538, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s earnings.", "start": 1607538, "end": 1607549, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1607556, "text": "The occurrence of extraordinary events could also negatively impact the financial condition or creditworthiness of JPMorganChase’s clients and customers, and could lead to an increase in the allowance for credit losses and higher net charge-offs, which could reduce JPMorganChase’s earnings."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1607759, "parts": [{"text": "Any failure to maintain adequate data management processes could adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1607866, "end": 1607961, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1607961, "end": 1607968, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to effectively manage its businesses, comply with applicable law or make informed business decisions.", "start": 1607968, "end": 1608079, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1608086, "text": "Any failure to maintain adequate data management processes could adversely affect JPMorganChase’s ability to effectively manage its businesses, comply with applicable law or make informed business decisions."}
