{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1613121, "parts": [{"text": "fraud detection and prevention processes.", "start": 1613245, "end": 1613286, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1613293, "text": "fraud detection and prevention processes."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1613330, "parts": [{"text": "Any of these deficiencies could impair JPMorganChase", "start": 1613437, "end": 1613489, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1613489, "end": 1613496, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to make sound business decisions, cause it to incur higher operational and compliance costs, result in operational breakdowns or failure to meet regulatory requirements, negatively affect clients and customers, or cause reputational harm.", "start": 1613496, "end": 1613744, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1613751, "text": "Any of these deficiencies could impair JPMorganChase’s ability to make sound business decisions, cause it to incur higher operational and compliance costs, result in operational breakdowns or failure to meet regulatory requirements, negatively affect clients and customers, or cause reputational harm."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1613788, "parts": [{"text": "In addition, if a third-party, whether authorized or unauthorized, obtains and misappropriates data from JPMorganChase", "start": 1613895, "end": 1614013, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1614013, "end": 1614020, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s systems, JPMorganChase and its clients and customers could experience negative outcomes, including a heightened risk of fraudulent transactions using JPMorganChase", "start": 1614020, "end": 1614185, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1614185, "end": 1614192, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s systems, losses from fraudulent transactions and reputational harm from perceived system insecurity.", "start": 1614192, "end": 1614294, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1614301, "text": "In addition, if a third-party, whether authorized or unauthorized, obtains and misappropriates data from JPMorganChase’s systems, JPMorganChase and its clients and customers could experience negative outcomes, including a heightened risk of fraudulent transactions using JPMorganChase’s systems, losses from fraudulent transactions and reputational harm from perceived system insecurity."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1615001, "parts": [{"text": "25", "start": 1615106, "end": 1615108, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1615115, "text": "25"}
