{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1615498, "parts": [{"text": "Enhanced regulatory and other standards for the oversight of JPMorganChase", "start": 1615605, "end": 1615679, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1615679, "end": 1615686, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s vendors and other service providers could result in higher costs and other potential exposures.", "start": 1615686, "end": 1615783, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1615790, "text": "Enhanced regulatory and other standards for the oversight of JPMorganChase’s vendors and other service providers could result in higher costs and other potential exposures."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1615827, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase must comply with enhanced regulatory and other standards when doing business with vendors and other service providers, including those relating to the outsourcing of functions as well as the performance of significant banking and other functions by subsidiaries. JPMorganChase", "start": 1615934, "end": 1616224, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1616224, "end": 1616231, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s failure to appropriately assess and manage these relationships, especially those involving significant banking functions, shared services or other critical activities, could materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase. Specifically, any such failure could result in:", "start": 1616231, "end": 1616501, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1616508, "text": "JPMorganChase must comply with enhanced regulatory and other standards when doing business with vendors and other service providers, including those relating to the outsourcing of functions as well as the performance of significant banking and other functions by subsidiaries. JPMorganChase’s failure to appropriately assess and manage these relationships, especially those involving significant banking functions, shared services or other critical activities, could materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase. Specifically, any such failure could result in:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1616579, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1616686, "end": 1616693, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1616700, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1616700, "parts": [{"text": "potential harm to clients and customers, and any liability associated with that harm", "start": 1616824, "end": 1616908, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1616915, "text": "potential harm to clients and customers, and any liability associated with that harm"}
