{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1622065, "parts": [{"text": "cause reputational harm.", "start": 1622189, "end": 1622213, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1622220, "text": "cause reputational harm."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1622257, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase could recognize unexpected losses, its capital levels could be reduced and it could face greater regulatory scrutiny if its models, estimations or judgments, including those used in its financial statements, are inadequate or incorrect.", "start": 1622364, "end": 1622614, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1622621, "text": "JPMorganChase could recognize unexpected losses, its capital levels could be reduced and it could face greater regulatory scrutiny if its models, estimations or judgments, including those used in its financial statements, are inadequate or incorrect."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1622658, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase uses various models and other analytical and judgment-based estimations to measure, monitor and implement controls related to its ", "start": 1622765, "end": 1622909, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1622916, "text": "JPMorganChase uses various models and other analytical and judgment-based estimations to measure, monitor and implement controls related to its"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1623119, "parts": [{"text": "market, credit, capital, liquidity, operational and other risks, as well as to prepare its financial statements under U.S. generally accepted accounting principles (", "start": 1623226, "end": 1623391, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8220;", "start": 1623391, "end": 1623398, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "U.S. GAAP", "start": 1623398, "end": 1623407, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8221;", "start": 1623407, "end": 1623414, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "). These models and estimations are based on historical trends and other assumptions that are periodically reviewed and modified. The models and estimations that JPMorganChase uses may not be effective in all cases to identify, observe and mitigate risk because of factors such as:", "start": 1623414, "end": 1623695, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1623702, "text": "market, credit, capital, liquidity, operational and other risks, as well as to prepare its financial statements under U.S. generally accepted accounting principles (“U.S. GAAP”). These models and estimations are based on historical trends and other assumptions that are periodically reviewed and modified. The models and estimations that JPMorganChase uses may not be effective in all cases to identify, observe and mitigate risk because of factors such as:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1623773, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1623880, "end": 1623887, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1623894, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1623894, "parts": [{"text": "their reliance on historical trends that may not persist, including assumptions underlying the models and estimations such as correlations among certain market indicators or asset prices", "start": 1624018, "end": 1624204, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1624211, "text": "their reliance on historical trends that may not persist, including assumptions underlying the models and estimations such as correlations among certain market indicators or asset prices"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1624282, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1624389, "end": 1624396, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1624403, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1624403, "parts": [{"text": "inherent limitations associated with forecasting uncertain economic and financial outcomes", "start": 1624527, "end": 1624617, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1624624, "text": "inherent limitations associated with forecasting uncertain economic and financial outcomes"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1624695, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1624802, "end": 1624809, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1624816, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1624816, "parts": [{"text": "historical trend information may be incomplete, or may not be indicative of severely negative market conditions such as extreme volatility, dislocation or lack of liquidity", "start": 1624940, "end": 1625112, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1625119, "text": "historical trend information may be incomplete, or may not be indicative of severely negative market conditions such as extreme volatility, dislocation or lack of liquidity"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1625190, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1625297, "end": 1625304, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1625311, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1625311, "parts": [{"text": "sudden illiquidity in markets or declines in prices of certain loans and securities could make it more difficult to value certain financial instruments", "start": 1625435, "end": 1625586, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1625593, "text": "sudden illiquidity in markets or declines in prices of certain loans and securities could make it more difficult to value certain financial instruments"}
