{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1625785, "parts": [{"text": "technology that is introduced to run models or estimations may not perform as expected, or may not be well understood by the personnel using the technology", "start": 1625909, "end": 1626064, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1626071, "text": "technology that is introduced to run models or estimations may not perform as expected, or may not be well understood by the personnel using the technology"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1626142, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1626249, "end": 1626256, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1626263, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1626263, "parts": [{"text": "models and estimations may contain erroneous data, valuations, formulas or algorithms", "start": 1626387, "end": 1626472, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1626479, "text": "models and estimations may contain erroneous data, valuations, formulas or algorithms"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1626550, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1626657, "end": 1626664, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1626671, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1626671, "parts": [{"text": "review processes may fail to detect flaws in models and estimations, and", "start": 1626795, "end": 1626867, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1626874, "text": "review processes may fail to detect flaws in models and estimations, and"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1626945, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1627052, "end": 1627059, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1627066, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1627066, "parts": [{"text": "models may inadvertently incorporate biases present in data used in the models.", "start": 1627190, "end": 1627269, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1627276, "text": "models may inadvertently incorporate biases present in data used in the models."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1627313, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase could incur unexpected losses if models and estimations used in connection with its risk management activities or the preparation of its financial statements are inadequate or incorrect. For example, where quoted market prices are not available for certain financial instruments that require a determination of their fair value, JPMorganChase may make fair value determinations based on internally developed models or other means which ultimately rely to some degree on management estimates and judgment. In addition, the reliability of JPMorganChase", "start": 1627420, "end": 1627984, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1627984, "end": 1627991, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s models and estimations could become more uncertain if assets differ from those used to develop those models and estimations, which could also result in unexpected losses.", "start": 1627991, "end": 1628163, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1628170, "text": "JPMorganChase could incur unexpected losses if models and estimations used in connection with its risk management activities or the preparation of its financial statements are inadequate or incorrect. For example, where quoted market prices are not available for certain financial instruments that require a determination of their fair value, JPMorganChase may make fair value determinations based on internally developed models or other means which ultimately rely to some degree on management estimates and judgment. In addition, the reliability of JPMorganChase’s models and estimations could become more uncertain if assets differ from those used to develop those models and estimations, which could also result in unexpected losses."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1628207, "parts": [{"text": "Similarly, JPMorganChase establishes an allowance for expected losses related to its credit exposures which requires significant judgments, including forecasts of how macroeconomic conditions might impair the ability of JPMorganChase", "start": 1628314, "end": 1628547, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1628547, "end": 1628554, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s clients and customers to repay their loans or other obligations. These types of estimates and judgments may be inaccurate due to a variety of factors, including if the current and forecasted environments are significantly different ", "start": 1628554, "end": 1628788, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1628795, "text": "Similarly, JPMorganChase establishes an allowance for expected losses related to its credit exposures which requires significant judgments, including forecasts of how macroeconomic conditions might impair the ability of JPMorganChase’s clients and customers to repay their loans or other obligations. These types of estimates and judgments may be inaccurate due to a variety of factors, including if the current and forecasted environments are significantly different"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1629367, "parts": [{"text": "26", "start": 1629472, "end": 1629474, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1629481, "text": "26"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1629841, "parts": [{"text": "from the historical environments upon which the models were developed. Any heightened uncertainty associated with these estimates may necessitate a greater degree of judgment and analytics to inform any adjustments that JPMorganChase may make to model outputs.", "start": 1629948, "end": 1630208, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1630215, "text": "from the historical environments upon which the models were developed. Any heightened uncertainty associated with these estimates may necessitate a greater degree of judgment and analytics to inform any adjustments that JPMorganChase may make to model outputs."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1630252, "parts": [{"text": "Some models and estimations used by JPMorganChase for managing risks require regulatory review and approval before JPMorganChase may use the models and estimations for calculating market risk RWA, credit risk RWA and operational risk RWA under Basel III. If JPMorganChase", "start": 1630359, "end": 1630630, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1630630, "end": 1630637, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s models and estimations are not approved by its regulators, it could be subject to higher capital charges, which could adversely affect its financial results or limit its ability to expand its businesses.", "start": 1630637, "end": 1630842, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1630849, "text": "Some models and estimations used by JPMorganChase for managing risks require regulatory review and approval before JPMorganChase may use the models and estimations for calculating market risk RWA, credit risk RWA and operational risk RWA under Basel III. If JPMorganChase’s models and estimations are not approved by its regulators, it could be subject to higher capital charges, which could adversely affect its financial results or limit its ability to expand its businesses."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1630886, "parts": [{"text": "A significant inadequacy in disclosure or financial reporting controls could negatively affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1630993, "end": 1631101, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1631101, "end": 1631108, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business, operations and reputation.", "start": 1631108, "end": 1631146, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1631153, "text": "A significant inadequacy in disclosure or financial reporting controls could negatively affect JPMorganChase’s business, operations and reputation."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1631190, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase is subject to complex global financial reporting obligations that require continuous enhancements to disclosures in its financial statements and regulatory reports. JPMorganChase", "start": 1631297, "end": 1631489, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1631489, "end": 1631496, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s disclosure and financial reporting controls may not always be effective, and a material weakness or significant deficiency in internal control over financial reporting could occur. Any such significant lapse, weakness or deficiency could result in inaccurate financial reporting which, in turn, could:", "start": 1631496, "end": 1631799, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1631806, "text": "JPMorganChase is subject to complex global financial reporting obligations that require continuous enhancements to disclosures in its financial statements and regulatory reports. JPMorganChase’s disclosure and financial reporting controls may not always be effective, and a material weakness or significant deficiency in internal control over financial reporting could occur. Any such significant lapse, weakness or deficiency could result in inaccurate financial reporting which, in turn, could:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1631877, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1631984, "end": 1631991, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1631998, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1631998, "parts": [{"text": "materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1632122, "end": 1632167, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1632167, "end": 1632174, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business and results of operations or financial condition", "start": 1632174, "end": 1632233, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1632240, "text": "materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase’s business and results of operations or financial condition"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1632311, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1632418, "end": 1632425, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1632432, "text": "•"}
