{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1633933, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1634040, "end": 1634053, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1634053, "end": 1634060, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s results or competitive standing could suffer if its management fails to develop and execute effective business strategies and to anticipate changes affecting those strategies.", "start": 1634060, "end": 1634237, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1634244, "text": "JPMorganChase’s results or competitive standing could suffer if its management fails to develop and execute effective business strategies and to anticipate changes affecting those strategies."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1634281, "parts": [{"text": "The ability of JPMorganChase", "start": 1634388, "end": 1634416, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1634416, "end": 1634423, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s management to develop and execute effective business strategies, and the ability to anticipate and respond to shifts in the competitive environment, are critical to JPMorganChase", "start": 1634423, "end": 1634603, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1634603, "end": 1634610, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s competitive standing and to achieving its strategic objectives. These strategies relate to:", "start": 1634610, "end": 1634703, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1634710, "text": "The ability of JPMorganChase’s management to develop and execute effective business strategies, and the ability to anticipate and respond to shifts in the competitive environment, are critical to JPMorganChase’s competitive standing and to achieving its strategic objectives. These strategies relate to:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1634781, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1634888, "end": 1634895, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1634902, "text": "•"}
