{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1637590, "parts": [{"text": "The values and growth prospects of JPMorganChase", "start": 1637697, "end": 1637745, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1637745, "end": 1637752, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses could suffer and its earnings could decline if management makes strategic choices that prove to be incorrect, are based on incomplete, inaccurate or fraudulent information, do not accurately assess the competitive landscape and industry trends, or fail to address changing regulatory and market environments or the expectations of clients, customers, investors, employees and other stakeholders. ", "start": 1637752, "end": 1638161, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1638168, "text": "The values and growth prospects of JPMorganChase’s businesses could suffer and its earnings could decline if management makes strategic choices that prove to be incorrect, are based on incomplete, inaccurate or fraudulent information, do not accurately assess the competitive landscape and industry trends, or fail to address changing regulatory and market environments or the expectations of clients, customers, investors, employees and other stakeholders."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1638205, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1638312, "end": 1638325, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1638325, "end": 1638332, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s growth prospects also depend on management", "start": 1638332, "end": 1638376, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1638376, "end": 1638383, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to develop and execute effective business plans to address these strategic priorities, both over near term and longer time horizons. Management", "start": 1638383, "end": 1638536, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1638536, "end": 1638543, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s effectiveness in this regard will affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1638543, "end": 1638599, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1638599, "end": 1638606, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to develop its resources, control expenses and return capital to shareholders. Each of these objectives could be adversely affected by any failure by management to:", "start": 1638606, "end": 1638780, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1638787, "text": "JPMorganChase’s growth prospects also depend on management’s ability to develop and execute effective business plans to address these strategic priorities, both over near term and longer time horizons. Management’s effectiveness in this regard will affect JPMorganChase’s ability to develop its resources, control expenses and return capital to shareholders. Each of these objectives could be adversely affected by any failure by management to:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1638858, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1638965, "end": 1638972, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1638979, "text": "•"}
