{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1642666, "parts": [{"text": "develop the operational, technology, risk, financial and managerial capabilities necessary to grow and manage JPMorganChase", "start": 1642790, "end": 1642913, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1642913, "end": 1642920, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses.", "start": 1642920, "end": 1642933, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1642940, "text": "develop the operational, technology, risk, financial and managerial capabilities necessary to grow and manage JPMorganChase’s businesses."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1642977, "parts": [{"text": "Furthermore, any expenses that JPMorganChase may incur in connection with disposing of assets, including excess properties, or exiting businesses or products could be material to its results of operations.", "start": 1643084, "end": 1643289, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1643296, "text": "Furthermore, any expenses that JPMorganChase may incur in connection with disposing of assets, including excess properties, or exiting businesses or products could be material to its results of operations."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1643996, "parts": [{"text": "27", "start": 1644101, "end": 1644103, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1644110, "text": "27"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1644236, "parts": [{"text": "Part I", "start": 1644342, "end": 1644348, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1644355, "text": "Part I"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1644493, "parts": [{"text": "Competition in the financial services industry could lead to negative effects on JPMorganChase", "start": 1644600, "end": 1644694, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1644694, "end": 1644701, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s results of operations.", "start": 1644701, "end": 1644725, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1644732, "text": "Competition in the financial services industry could lead to negative effects on JPMorganChase’s results of operations."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1644769, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase operates in a highly competitive environment in which it must constantly adapt to changes in financial regulation, technological advances and economic conditions. JPMorganChase expects that competition in the financial services industry will remain intense, with new competitors in the financial services industry continuing to emerge. For example, technological advances and the growth of e-commerce have made it possible for non-depository institutions to offer products and services that traditionally were banking products. These advances have also allowed financial institutions and other companies to provide electronic and internet-based financial solutions, including:", "start": 1644876, "end": 1645566, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1645573, "text": "JPMorganChase operates in a highly competitive environment in which it must constantly adapt to changes in financial regulation, technological advances and economic conditions. JPMorganChase expects that competition in the financial services industry will remain intense, with new competitors in the financial services industry continuing to emerge. For example, technological advances and the growth of e-commerce have made it possible for non-depository institutions to offer products and services that traditionally were banking products. These advances have also allowed financial institutions and other companies to provide electronic and internet-based financial solutions, including:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1645644, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1645751, "end": 1645758, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1645765, "text": "•"}
