{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1647190, "parts": [{"text": "online automated algorithmic-based investment advice. ", "start": 1647314, "end": 1647368, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1647375, "text": "online automated algorithmic-based investment advice."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1647412, "parts": [{"text": "Furthermore, both financial institutions and their non-banking competitors face the risk of disruption to payments processing and other products and services from the use of new technologies that may not require intermediation, such as tokenized securities or other products that leverage distributed ledger technology. New technologies have required and could require JPMorganChase to increase expenditures to modify its products to attract and retain clients and customers or to match products and services offered by its competitors, including technology companies. If JPMorganChase does not keep pace with rapidly changing technological advances, including the adoption of generative AI, it risks losing clients and market share to competitors, which could negatively impact revenues, operating costs and its competitive position. Competition could be intensified as the feasibility, capability and scalability of new technologies improves. In addition, new technologies (including generative AI) could be used by customers or bad actors in unexpected or disruptive ways, or could be breached or infiltrated by third parties, which could increase JPMorganChase", "start": 1647519, "end": 1648683, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1648683, "end": 1648690, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s compliance expenses and reduce its income related to the offering of products and services through those technologies.", "start": 1648690, "end": 1648810, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1648817, "text": "Furthermore, both financial institutions and their non-banking competitors face the risk of disruption to payments processing and other products and services from the use of new technologies that may not require intermediation, such as tokenized securities or other products that leverage distributed ledger technology. New technologies have required and could require JPMorganChase to increase expenditures to modify its products to attract and retain clients and customers or to match products and services offered by its competitors, including technology companies. If JPMorganChase does not keep pace with rapidly changing technological advances, including the adoption of generative AI, it risks losing clients and market share to competitors, which could negatively impact revenues, operating costs and its competitive position. Competition could be intensified as the feasibility, capability and scalability of new technologies improves. In addition, new technologies (including generative AI) could be used by customers or bad actors in unexpected or disruptive ways, or could be breached or infiltrated by third parties, which could increase JPMorganChase’s compliance expenses and reduce its income related to the offering of products and services through those technologies."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1648854, "parts": [{"text": "Actions by competitors could put pressure on the pricing for JPMorganChase", "start": 1648961, "end": 1649035, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1649035, "end": 1649042, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s products and services or could cause it to lose market share, particularly with respect to investment products and traditional banking products. In addition, advocacy by non-banking competitors for exemptions from regulatory requirements could significantly disadvantage traditional financial institutions. ", "start": 1649042, "end": 1649351, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1649358, "text": "Actions by competitors could put pressure on the pricing for JPMorganChase’s products and services or could cause it to lose market share, particularly with respect to investment products and traditional banking products. In addition, advocacy by non-banking competitors for exemptions from regulatory requirements could significantly disadvantage traditional financial institutions."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1649561, "parts": [{"text": "The failure of any of JPMorganChase", "start": 1649668, "end": 1649703, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1649703, "end": 1649710, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses to meet the expectations of clients and customers, whether due to general market conditions, under-performance, a decision not to offer a particular product or service, changes in client and customer expectations or other factors, could affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1649710, "end": 1649980, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1649980, "end": 1649987, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to attract or retain clients and customers. Any of these impacts could, in turn, reduce JPMorganChase", "start": 1649987, "end": 1650098, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1650098, "end": 1650105, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s revenues. Increased competition also could require JPMorganChase to make additional capital investments in its businesses, or to extend more of its capital on behalf of its clients to remain competitive. Furthermore, regulatory uncertainty regarding new technologies, including inconsistent regulatory approaches within and across jurisdictions, could require JPMorganChase to modify or restrict its product and service offerings, incur higher operational or compliance costs or forgo business opportunities.", "start": 1650105, "end": 1650615, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1650622, "text": "The failure of any of JPMorganChase’s businesses to meet the expectations of clients and customers, whether due to general market conditions, under-performance, a decision not to offer a particular product or service, changes in client and customer expectations or other factors, could affect JPMorganChase’s ability to attract or retain clients and customers. Any of these impacts could, in turn, reduce JPMorganChase’s revenues. Increased competition also could require JPMorganChase to make additional capital investments in its businesses, or to extend more of its capital on behalf of its clients to remain competitive. Furthermore, regulatory uncertainty regarding new technologies, including inconsistent regulatory approaches within and across jurisdictions, could require JPMorganChase to modify or restrict its product and service offerings, incur higher operational or compliance costs or forgo business opportunities."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1650659, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1650766, "end": 1650779, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1650779, "end": 1650786, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operations, results, and competitive standing could be adversely affected by the development of advanced technologies such as AI.", "start": 1650786, "end": 1650917, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1650924, "text": "JPMorganChase’s operations, results, and competitive standing could be adversely affected by the development of advanced technologies such as AI."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1650961, "parts": [{"text": "The rapid development and deployment of advanced technologies, including generative and agentic AI systems, present a range of risks to JPMorganChase", "start": 1651068, "end": 1651217, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1651217, "end": 1651224, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s businesses and operations, including:", "start": 1651224, "end": 1651263, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1651270, "text": "The rapid development and deployment of advanced technologies, including generative and agentic AI systems, present a range of risks to JPMorganChase’s businesses and operations, including:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1651341, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1651448, "end": 1651455, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1651462, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1651462, "parts": [{"text": "AI system failures, inappropriate use of AI systems, lack of transparency in AI systems, or inaccurate or biased output from AI systems resulting from rapid deployment, insufficient testing, erroneous data, ineffective model design or insufficient controls, which could disrupt operations, cause erroneous transactions, compromise data privacy, infringe on intellectual property, harm clients and customers, or impair JPMorganChase", "start": 1651586, "end": 1652017, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1652017, "end": 1652024, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to make sound business decisions", "start": 1652024, "end": 1652066, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1652073, "text": "AI system failures, inappropriate use of AI systems, lack of transparency in AI systems, or inaccurate or biased output from AI systems resulting from rapid deployment, insufficient testing, erroneous data, ineffective model design or insufficient controls, which could disrupt operations, cause erroneous transactions, compromise data privacy, infringe on intellectual property, harm clients and customers, or impair JPMorganChase’s ability to make sound business decisions"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1652144, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1652251, "end": 1652258, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1652265, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1652265, "parts": [{"text": "increased exposure to cyber attacks, system manipulation, or data loss if AI systems, particularly agentic systems, are not designed and implemented with appropriate safeguards to prevent systems from accessing sensitive data sources or system resources and taking actions", "start": 1652389, "end": 1652661, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1652668, "text": "increased exposure to cyber attacks, system manipulation, or data loss if AI systems, particularly agentic systems, are not designed and implemented with appropriate safeguards to prevent systems from accessing sensitive data sources or system resources and taking actions"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1652739, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1652846, "end": 1652853, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1652860, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1652860, "parts": [{"text": "intensified AI-enabled cyber threats, which may allow malicious actors to exploit vulnerabilities, reverse-engineer security patches, and conduct sophisticated social engineering attacks, potentially resulting in unauthorized access to sensitive information and data breaches, especially if JPMorganChase fails to adequately maintain, secure and upgrade its technological infrastructure in response to rapidly evolving technological advances", "start": 1652984, "end": 1653425, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1653432, "text": "intensified AI-enabled cyber threats, which may allow malicious actors to exploit vulnerabilities, reverse-engineer security patches, and conduct sophisticated social engineering attacks, potentially resulting in unauthorized access to sensitive information and data breaches, especially if JPMorganChase fails to adequately maintain, secure and upgrade its technological infrastructure in response to rapidly evolving technological advances"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1653503, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1653610, "end": 1653617, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1653624, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1653624, "parts": [{"text": "regulatory and compliance challenges arising from rapidly evolving applicable law, including differences, inconsistencies and conflicts in international standards, which could increase costs, lead to fines and sanctions, and restrict JPMorganChase", "start": 1653748, "end": 1653995, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1653995, "end": 1654002, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s use of AI technologies", "start": 1654002, "end": 1654026, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1654033, "text": "regulatory and compliance challenges arising from rapidly evolving applicable law, including differences, inconsistencies and conflicts in international standards, which could increase costs, lead to fines and sanctions, and restrict JPMorganChase’s use of AI technologies"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1654605, "parts": [{"text": "28", "start": 1654710, "end": 1654712, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1654719, "text": "28"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1655113, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1655220, "end": 1655227, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1655234, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1655234, "parts": [{"text": "competitive disadvantage if competitors are able to deploy AI more quickly or effectively, potentially gaining advantages in cost efficiency, client and customer experience, or product innovation, which could result in a loss of market share to competitors, or", "start": 1655358, "end": 1655618, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1655625, "text": "competitive disadvantage if competitors are able to deploy AI more quickly or effectively, potentially gaining advantages in cost efficiency, client and customer experience, or product innovation, which could result in a loss of market share to competitors, or"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1655696, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1655803, "end": 1655810, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1655817, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1655817, "parts": [{"text": "replacement or disintermediation of direct customer relationships if AI agents autonomously manage or intermediate financial decisions and product selection or other services for customers.", "start": 1655941, "end": 1656130, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1656137, "text": "replacement or disintermediation of direct customer relationships if AI agents autonomously manage or intermediate financial decisions and product selection or other services for customers."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1656174, "parts": [{"text": "It is also possible that JPMorganChase could miscalibrate its workforce planning and employee training efforts either because of over-reliance on AI or the failure to appropriately adopt AI. Over-reliance on AI could cause JPMorganChase to experience shortages in qualified staff due to reduced hiring or retention of employees, or could hinder the development or enhancement of important skills among its employees, including critical thinking, problem-solving, judgment, creativity and adaptability. On the other hand, any efficiencies or competitive advantages that AI may offer could be squandered if JPMorganChase fails to adopt AI in a timely and judicious manner and to make related adjustments to its workforce.", "start": 1656281, "end": 1657000, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1657007, "text": "It is also possible that JPMorganChase could miscalibrate its workforce planning and employee training efforts either because of over-reliance on AI or the failure to appropriately adopt AI. Over-reliance on AI could cause JPMorganChase to experience shortages in qualified staff due to reduced hiring or retention of employees, or could hinder the development or enhancement of important skills among its employees, including critical thinking, problem-solving, judgment, creativity and adaptability. On the other hand, any efficiencies or competitive advantages that AI may offer could be squandered if JPMorganChase fails to adopt AI in a timely and judicious manner and to make related adjustments to its workforce."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1657044, "parts": [{"text": "Any of these factors could materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1657151, "end": 1657223, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1657223, "end": 1657230, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business and operations, results of operations, competitive position or reputation.", "start": 1657230, "end": 1657315, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1657322, "text": "Any of these factors could materially and adversely affect JPMorganChase’s business and operations, results of operations, competitive position or reputation."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1657359, "parts": [{"text": "The effects of climate change could adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1657466, "end": 1657532, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1657532, "end": 1657539, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business and operations, both directly and as a result of impacts on its clients and customers.", "start": 1657539, "end": 1657636, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1657643, "text": "The effects of climate change could adversely affect JPMorganChase’s business and operations, both directly and as a result of impacts on its clients and customers."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1657680, "parts": [{"text": "Both physical risks and transition risks associated with climate change could negatively impact JPMorganChase and its clients and customers. Physical risks include the increased frequency or severity of acute weather events and shifting climate patterns, which may lead to lower asset values, increased insurance costs, and business and supply chain disruptions. Transition risks, including evolving regulatory requirements, carbon taxes and the adoption of new technologies to support lower-carbon operations, may increase compliance and operational costs, contribute to commodity price volatility and impact the profitability of clients and customers that are adapting to a low-carbon economy. Any of these impacts could have a negative effect on the financial condition of JPMorganChase, the financial condition or creditworthiness of JPMorganChase", "start": 1657787, "end": 1658638, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1658638, "end": 1658645, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s clients and customers, JPMorganChase", "start": 1658645, "end": 1658683, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1658683, "end": 1658690, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s exposure to affected companies and markets, or the effectiveness of JPMorganChase", "start": 1658690, "end": 1658773, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1658773, "end": 1658780, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s existing business strategy.", "start": 1658780, "end": 1658809, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1658816, "text": "Both physical risks and transition risks associated with climate change could negatively impact JPMorganChase and its clients and customers. Physical risks include the increased frequency or severity of acute weather events and shifting climate patterns, which may lead to lower asset values, increased insurance costs, and business and supply chain disruptions. Transition risks, including evolving regulatory requirements, carbon taxes and the adoption of new technologies to support lower-carbon operations, may increase compliance and operational costs, contribute to commodity price volatility and impact the profitability of clients and customers that are adapting to a low-carbon economy. Any of these impacts could have a negative effect on the financial condition of JPMorganChase, the financial condition or creditworthiness of JPMorganChase’s clients and customers, JPMorganChase’s exposure to affected companies and markets, or the effectiveness of JPMorganChase’s existing business strategy."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#8f5a39;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1659019, "parts": [{"text": "Conduct", "start": 1659126, "end": 1659133, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1659140, "text": "Conduct"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1659177, "parts": [{"text": "Conduct failure by JPMorganChase employees could trigger litigation and regulatory actions and harm JPMorganChase", "start": 1659284, "end": 1659397, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1659397, "end": 1659404, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s reputation.", "start": 1659404, "end": 1659417, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1659424, "text": "Conduct failure by JPMorganChase employees could trigger litigation and regulatory actions and harm JPMorganChase’s reputation."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1659461, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase expects its employees to conduct themselves ethically and in compliance with JPMorganChase", "start": 1659568, "end": 1659672, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1659672, "end": 1659679, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s Code of Conduct, as well as with internal policies and applicable laws and regulations. Notwithstanding these expectations, employees of JPMorganChase have in the past engaged and could in the future engage in improper or illegal conduct. These instances of misconduct have resulted and could in the future result in litigation and resolutions of investigations or enforcement actions by governmental authorities involving consent orders, deferred prosecution agreements, non-prosecution agreements and other civil or criminal sanctions and penalties. In addition, employee misconduct could lead to higher operational and compliance costs, harm JPMorganChase", "start": 1659679, "end": 1660339, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1660339, "end": 1660346, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s reputation and result in collateral consequences for its business and operations. The foregoing risks could be heightened with respect to newly-acquired businesses if JPMorganChase fails to successfully integrate employees of those businesses or any of those employees engage in misconduct.", "start": 1660346, "end": 1660638, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1660645, "text": "JPMorganChase expects its employees to conduct themselves ethically and in compliance with JPMorganChase’s Code of Conduct, as well as with internal policies and applicable laws and regulations. Notwithstanding these expectations, employees of JPMorganChase have in the past engaged and could in the future engage in improper or illegal conduct. These instances of misconduct have resulted and could in the future result in litigation and resolutions of investigations or enforcement actions by governmental authorities involving consent orders, deferred prosecution agreements, non-prosecution agreements and other civil or criminal sanctions and penalties. In addition, employee misconduct could lead to higher operational and compliance costs, harm JPMorganChase’s reputation and result in collateral consequences for its business and operations. The foregoing risks could be heightened with respect to newly-acquired businesses if JPMorganChase fails to successfully integrate employees of those businesses or any of those employees engage in misconduct."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#8f5a39;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1660682, "parts": [{"text": "Reputation", "start": 1660789, "end": 1660799, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1660806, "text": "Reputation"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1660843, "parts": [{"text": "Damage to JPMorganChase", "start": 1660950, "end": 1660973, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1660973, "end": 1660980, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s reputation could negatively affect its business, results and prospects.", "start": 1660980, "end": 1661053, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1661060, "text": "Damage to JPMorganChase’s reputation could negatively affect its business, results and prospects."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1661097, "parts": [{"text": "Maintaining the trust, affinity and goodwill of clients, customers, employees and investors is critical to JPMorganChase", "start": 1661204, "end": 1661324, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1661324, "end": 1661331, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to operate its business successfully. JPMorganChase", "start": 1661331, "end": 1661392, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1661392, "end": 1661399, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s reputation could be harmed by its decisions to engage or not engage with a client or in a business activity that lead to negative commercial impacts, and could also be compromised by:", "start": 1661399, "end": 1661584, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1661591, "text": "Maintaining the trust, affinity and goodwill of clients, customers, employees and investors is critical to JPMorganChase’s ability to operate its business successfully. JPMorganChase’s reputation could be harmed by its decisions to engage or not engage with a client or in a business activity that lead to negative commercial impacts, and could also be compromised by:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1661662, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1661769, "end": 1661776, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1661783, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1661783, "parts": [{"text": "inaccurate or misleading information about JPMorganChase or its clients, including results generated by AI, that is rapidly and broadly disseminated through any form of media, including social networking sites, and", "start": 1661907, "end": 1662121, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1662128, "text": "inaccurate or misleading information about JPMorganChase or its clients, including results generated by AI, that is rapidly and broadly disseminated through any form of media, including social networking sites, and"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1662199, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1662306, "end": 1662313, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1662320, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1662320, "parts": [{"text": "concerns that JPMorganChase has treated certain clients or customers unfairly", "start": 1662444, "end": 1662521, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1662528, "text": "concerns that JPMorganChase has treated certain clients or customers unfairly"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1662565, "parts": [{"text": "Events or circumstances that damage JPMorganChase", "start": 1662672, "end": 1662721, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1662721, "end": 1662728, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s reputation could also negatively affect its business, results of operations and prospects, and could result in:", "start": 1662728, "end": 1662841, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1662848, "text": "Events or circumstances that damage JPMorganChase’s reputation could also negatively affect its business, results of operations and prospects, and could result in:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1662919, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1663026, "end": 1663033, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1663040, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1663040, "parts": [{"text": "greater scrutiny from governmental authorities or criticism from politicians, including in the form of investigations by governmental authorities or litigation", "start": 1663164, "end": 1663323, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1663330, "text": "greater scrutiny from governmental authorities or criticism from politicians, including in the form of investigations by governmental authorities or litigation"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1663401, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1663508, "end": 1663515, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1663522, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1663522, "parts": [{"text": "unfavorable media coverage or commentary, including through social media campaigns", "start": 1663646, "end": 1663728, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1663735, "text": "unfavorable media coverage or commentary, including through social media campaigns"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1664435, "parts": [{"text": "29", "start": 1664540, "end": 1664542, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1664549, "text": "29"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1664675, "parts": [{"text": "Part I", "start": 1664781, "end": 1664787, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1664794, "text": "Part I"}
