{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1665087, "parts": [{"text": "certain clients and customers ceasing to do business with JPMorganChase, and encouraging others to do so", "start": 1665211, "end": 1665315, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1665322, "text": "certain clients and customers ceasing to do business with JPMorganChase, and encouraging others to do so"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1665393, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1665500, "end": 1665507, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1665514, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1665514, "parts": [{"text": "impairment of JPMorganChase", "start": 1665638, "end": 1665665, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1665665, "end": 1665672, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to attract new clients and customers, to expand its relationships with existing clients and customers, or to hire or retain employees, or", "start": 1665672, "end": 1665819, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1665826, "text": "impairment of JPMorganChase’s ability to attract new clients and customers, to expand its relationships with existing clients and customers, or to hire or retain employees, or"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1665897, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1666004, "end": 1666011, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1666018, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1666018, "parts": [{"text": "certain investors opting to divest from investments in securities of JPMorganChase.", "start": 1666142, "end": 1666225, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1666232, "text": "certain investors opting to divest from investments in securities of JPMorganChase."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1666269, "parts": [{"text": "Failure to effectively manage potential conflicts of interest or to satisfy fiduciary obligations could result in litigation and enforcement actions and cause reputational harm.", "start": 1666376, "end": 1666553, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1666560, "text": "Failure to effectively manage potential conflicts of interest or to satisfy fiduciary obligations could result in litigation and enforcement actions and cause reputational harm."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1666597, "parts": [{"text": "Managing potential conflicts of interest is highly complex for JPMorganChase due to its broad range of business activities which encompass a variety of transactions, obligations and interests with and among clients and customers. JPMorganChase could face litigation, enforcement actions and heightened regulatory scrutiny, and its reputation could be damaged, by the failure or perceived failure to:", "start": 1666704, "end": 1667103, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1667110, "text": "Managing potential conflicts of interest is highly complex for JPMorganChase due to its broad range of business activities which encompass a variety of transactions, obligations and interests with and among clients and customers. JPMorganChase could face litigation, enforcement actions and heightened regulatory scrutiny, and its reputation could be damaged, by the failure or perceived failure to:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1667181, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1667288, "end": 1667295, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1667302, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1667302, "parts": [{"text": "adequately address or appropriately disclose actual or potential conflicts of interest, including those that may arise in connection with providing multiple products and services in, or having investments related to, the same transaction", "start": 1667426, "end": 1667663, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1667670, "text": "adequately address or appropriately disclose actual or potential conflicts of interest, including those that may arise in connection with providing multiple products and services in, or having investments related to, the same transaction"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1667741, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1667848, "end": 1667855, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1667862, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1667862, "parts": [{"text": "identify and address any conflict of interest that a third-party with which it is does business may have with respect to a transaction involving JPMorganChase", "start": 1667986, "end": 1668144, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1668151, "text": "identify and address any conflict of interest that a third-party with which it is does business may have with respect to a transaction involving JPMorganChase"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1668222, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1668329, "end": 1668336, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1668343, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1668343, "parts": [{"text": "deliver appropriate standards of service and quality, and to treat clients and customers fairly and with the appropriate standard of care", "start": 1668467, "end": 1668604, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1668611, "text": "deliver appropriate standards of service and quality, and to treat clients and customers fairly and with the appropriate standard of care"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1668682, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1668789, "end": 1668796, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1668803, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1668803, "parts": [{"text": "provide fiduciary products or services in accordance with applicable law, or", "start": 1668927, "end": 1669003, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1669010, "text": "provide fiduciary products or services in accordance with applicable law, or"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1669081, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1669188, "end": 1669195, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1669202, "text": "•"}
