{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1683199, "parts": [{"text": "The impact of these actions could be accentuated in trading markets that are smaller, less liquid and more volatile than more-developed markets. These types of government actions can negatively affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1683306, "end": 1683520, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1683520, "end": 1683527, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operations in the relevant country, either directly or by suppressing the local business activities of clients.", "start": 1683527, "end": 1683640, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1683647, "text": "The impact of these actions could be accentuated in trading markets that are smaller, less liquid and more volatile than more-developed markets. These types of government actions can negatively affect JPMorganChase’s operations in the relevant country, either directly or by suppressing the local business activities of clients."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1683684, "parts": [{"text": "In addition, emerging markets countries, as well as more developed countries, have been susceptible to unfavorable social developments arising from poor economic conditions or governmental actions, including:", "start": 1683791, "end": 1683999, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1684006, "text": "In addition, emerging markets countries, as well as more developed countries, have been susceptible to unfavorable social developments arising from poor economic conditions or governmental actions, including:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1684077, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1684184, "end": 1684191, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1684198, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1684198, "parts": [{"text": "widespread demonstrations, civil unrest or general strikes", "start": 1684322, "end": 1684380, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1684387, "text": "widespread demonstrations, civil unrest or general strikes"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1684458, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1684565, "end": 1684572, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1684579, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1684579, "parts": [{"text": "crime and corruption", "start": 1684703, "end": 1684723, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1684730, "text": "crime and corruption"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1684801, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1684908, "end": 1684915, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1684922, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1684922, "parts": [{"text": "security and personal safety issues", "start": 1685046, "end": 1685081, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1685088, "text": "security and personal safety issues"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1685159, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1685266, "end": 1685273, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1685280, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1685280, "parts": [{"text": "outbreaks or escalations of hostilities, or other geopolitical instabilities", "start": 1685404, "end": 1685480, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1685487, "text": "outbreaks or escalations of hostilities, or other geopolitical instabilities"}
