{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1685679, "parts": [{"text": "overthrow of incumbent governments", "start": 1685803, "end": 1685837, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1685844, "text": "overthrow of incumbent governments"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1685915, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1686022, "end": 1686029, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1686036, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1686036, "parts": [{"text": "terrorist attacks, and", "start": 1686160, "end": 1686182, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1686189, "text": "terrorist attacks, and"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1686260, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1686367, "end": 1686374, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1686381, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1686381, "parts": [{"text": "other forms of internal discord.", "start": 1686505, "end": 1686537, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1686544, "text": "other forms of internal discord."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1686581, "parts": [{"text": "These types of developments have in the past resulted in, and in the future could lead to, conditions that could adversely affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1686688, "end": 1686831, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1686831, "end": 1686838, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operations in the affected countries and impair the revenues, growth and profitability of those operations. In addition, any of these events or circumstances in one country could affect JPMorganChase", "start": 1686838, "end": 1687039, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1687039, "end": 1687046, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s operations and investments in another country, including in the U.S.", "start": 1687046, "end": 1687116, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1687123, "text": "These types of developments have in the past resulted in, and in the future could lead to, conditions that could adversely affect JPMorganChase’s operations in the affected countries and impair the revenues, growth and profitability of those operations. In addition, any of these events or circumstances in one country could affect JPMorganChase’s operations and investments in another country, including in the U.S."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#8f5a39;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1687326, "parts": [{"text": "People", "start": 1687433, "end": 1687439, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1687446, "text": "People"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1687483, "parts": [{"text": "Various factors could impact JPMorganChase", "start": 1687590, "end": 1687632, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1687632, "end": 1687639, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}, {"text": "s workforce.", "start": 1687639, "end": 1687651, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1687658, "text": "Various factors could impact JPMorganChase’s workforce."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1687695, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1687802, "end": 1687815, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1687815, "end": 1687822, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s efforts to hire and retain talented employees could be hindered by factors such as:", "start": 1687822, "end": 1687907, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1687914, "text": "JPMorganChase’s efforts to hire and retain talented employees could be hindered by factors such as:"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1687985, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1688092, "end": 1688099, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1688106, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1688106, "parts": [{"text": "the emerging need for more-skilled workers in an evolving workplace environment, and ", "start": 1688230, "end": 1688315, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1688322, "text": "the emerging need for more-skilled workers in an evolving workplace environment, and"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1688393, "parts": [{"text": "&#8226;", "start": 1688500, "end": 1688507, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1688514, "text": "•"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:5pt"}, "start": 1688514, "parts": [{"text": "targeted recruitment of JPMorganChase employees by competitors.", "start": 1688638, "end": 1688701, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1688708, "text": "targeted recruitment of JPMorganChase employees by competitors."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1688745, "parts": [{"text": "JPMorganChase", "start": 1688852, "end": 1688865, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1688865, "end": 1688872, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s performance and competitive position could be materially and adversely affected if it is unable to attract or retain qualified employees or to effectively manage succession planning for key leadership roles, such as the Chief Executive Officer, members of the Operating Committee and other senior leaders. In addition, restrictive immigration or travel policies in the U.S. and other countries could inhibit JPMorganChase", "start": 1688872, "end": 1689295, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1689295, "end": 1689302, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s ability to attract and retain qualified employees, or necessitate adjustments to operating models that could reduce operational efficiency or increase costs.", "start": 1689302, "end": 1689461, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1689468, "text": "JPMorganChase’s performance and competitive position could be materially and adversely affected if it is unable to attract or retain qualified employees or to effectively manage succession planning for key leadership roles, such as the Chief Executive Officer, members of the Operating Committee and other senior leaders. In addition, restrictive immigration or travel policies in the U.S. and other countries could inhibit JPMorganChase’s ability to attract and retain qualified employees, or necessitate adjustments to operating models that could reduce operational efficiency or increase costs."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:9.9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1689505, "parts": [{"text": "Advances in technology, such as automation, AI and data science, could lead to workforce displacement. This could require JPMorganChase to invest in additional employee training, manage impacts on morale and retention, and compete for employment candidates who possess more advanced technological skills, all of which could have a negative impact on JPMorganChase", "start": 1689612, "end": 1689975, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "&#8217;", "start": 1689975, "end": 1689982, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}, {"text": "s business and operations.", "start": 1689982, "end": 1690008, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1690015, "text": "Advances in technology, such as automation, AI and data science, could lead to workforce displacement. This could require JPMorganChase to invest in additional employee training, manage impacts on morale and retention, and compete for employment candidates who possess more advanced technological skills, all of which could have a negative impact on JPMorganChase’s business and operations."}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"}, "start": 1690715, "parts": [{"text": "31", "start": 1690820, "end": 1690822, "emphasis": false, "italic": false}], "end": 1690829, "text": "31"}
{"tag": "span", "attrs": {"style": "color:#000000;font-family:'Sons',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"}, "start": 1691006, "parts": [{"text": "Parts I and II", "start": 1691112, "end": 1691126, "emphasis": true, "italic": false}], "end": 1691133, "text": "Parts I and II"}
